text":"[THINKING] I HAVE TO BE STRONG, AND BELIEVE IN SASUKE, NARUTO, AND KAKASHI SENSEI."},{"startMs":1392000,"endMs":1395000,"text":"AND I HAVE MY JOB TO DO, NO MATTER WHAT IT TAKES."},{"startMs":1395000,"endMs":1397000,"text":"HMM?"},{"startMs":1397000,"endMs":1400000,"text":"OH, SAKURA."},{"startMs":1400000,"endMs":1403000,"text":"FOLLOW MY LEAD, MR. TAZUNA, AND WHATEVER HAPPENS, STAY CLOSE."},{"startMs":1403000,"endMs":1408000,"text":"ALL RIGHT. I'LL STAY RIGHT BEHIND YOU."},{"startMs":1410000,"endMs":1412000,"text":"I KNOW YOU NEED ME, ZABUZA."},{"startMs":1412000,"endMs":1415000,"text":"I'LL FINISH THEM OFF QUICKLY."},{"startMs":1415000,"endMs":1417000,"text":"GRRR!"},{"startMs":1417000,"endMs":1418000,"text":"AHHH!"},{"startMs":1418000,"endMs":1421000,"text":"[GASPS] SHADOW CLONE JUTSU!"},{"startMs":1421000,"endMs":1428000,"text":"[CLONES SHOUTING AND GRUNTING] HE JUST WON'T GIVE UP."},{"startMs":1428000,"endMs":1438000,"text":"[CLONES GRUNTING] [GASPS] FIREBALL JUTSU."},{"startMs":1444000,"endMs":1449000,"text":"IT SHOULDN'T BE TAKING THIS LONG TO DEFEAT HIM."},{"startMs":1453000,"endMs":1461000,"text":"[GROWLS] [INHALES]"},{"startMs":1469000,"endMs":1472000,"text":"UNH! AHH!"},{"startMs":1472000,"endMs":1477000,"text":"AHH! UGH!"},{"startMs":1477000,"endMs":1480000,"text":"[GRUNTS] UNH! AHH!"},{"startMs":1480000,"endMs":1483000,"text":"[PANTING] [THINKG] HMM! GOT HIM THAT TIME!"},{"startMs":1483000,"endMs":1488000,"text":"I'M STARTING TO GET THE TIMING."},{"startMs":1496000,"endMs":1498000,"text":"IT'S THE HIDDEN MIST JUTSU."},{"startMs":1498000,"endMs":1501000,"text":"BUT THIS MIST IS EVEN TOO THICK FOR ZABUZA."},{"startMs":1501000,"endMs":1505000,"text":"HOW CAN HE FIGHT IN IT?"},{"startMs":1505000,"endMs":1510000,"text":"[WHISTLING AND SPINNING] HUH?"},{"startMs":1510000,"endMs":1514000,"text":"Zabuza: VERY SKILLFUL, AS I'D EXPECT FROM KAKASHI, THE SHARINGAN WARRIOR."},{"startMs":1514000,"endMs":1523000,"text":"[GASPS] HIS EYES ARE CLOSED."},{"startMs":1523000,"endMs":1529000,"text":"BUT NEXT TIME YOU SEE ME WILL BE THE LAST TIME YOU SEE ANYTHING."},{"startMs":1529000,"endMs":1532000,"text":"WITHOUT YOUR SHARINGAN, YOU'RE NOTHING."},{"startMs":1532000,"endMs":1534000,"text":"WHAT?"},{"startMs":1534000,"endMs":1540000,"text":"YOU WANTED ME TO BELIEVE YOU COULD SEE THROUGH ANYTHING, EVEN THROUGH TIME."},{"startMs":1540000,"endMs":1543000,"text":"UNH! ARGH!"},{"startMs":1543000,"endMs":1546000,"text":"HOW?"},{"startMs":1546000,"endMs":1549000,"text":"CAN YOU SEE INTO THE FUTURE?"},{"startMs":1549000,"endMs":1554000,"text":"YES. THIS IS YOUR LAST BATTLE-- EVER."},{"startMs":1554000,"endMs":1556000,"text":"BUT YOUR PREDICTION WAS WRONG."},{"startMs":1556000,"endMs":1558000,"text":"I'M STILL ALIVE."},{"startMs":1558000,"endMs":1560000,"text":"SO YOU'RE A FRAUD, KAKASHI."},{"startMs":1560000,"endMs":1564000,"text":"YOU CAN'T READ THE FUTURE, AND YOU CAN'T READ ME."},{"startMs":1564000,"endMs":1570000,"text":"SHARINGAN IS JUST A CHEAP TRICK THAT MAKES YOU SEEM MORE POWERFUL THAN YOU ARE."},{"startMs":1570000,"endMs":1578000,"text":"I KNOW NOW YOUR SHARINGAN HAS 2 SEPARATE ELEMENTS-- THE PIERCING EYE, WHICH SEES EVERY DETAIL,"},{"startMs":1578000,"endMs":1582000,"text":"AND THE HYPNOTIC EYE, WHICH MESMERIZES YOUR OPPONENT."},{"startMs":1582000,"endMs":1593000,"text":"EMPLOYING THESE ABILITIES, YOU CAN EXECUTE MULTIPLE JUTSU IN QUICK SUCCESSION TO MAKE IT SEEM LIKE YOU COULD SEE THE FUTURE."},{"startMs":1593000,"endMs":1598000,"text":"FIRST, WITH THE PIERCING EYE, YOU COPY MY MOVEMENTS INSTANTLY."},{"startMs":1598000,"endMs":1603000,"text":"THIS REPLICATION OF MOVEMENT MAKES ME DOUBT MY OWN THOUGHTS."},{"startMs":1603000,"endMs":1611000,"text":"[GASPS] ONCE I WAS SHAKEN, YOU INFILTRATED MY MIND,"},{"startMs":1611000,"endMs":1617000,"text":"WAITING FOR THE SLIGHTEST FLUTTER TO ANTICIPATE MY ACTIONS, SEEKING OUT ANY HINTS TO MY NEXT MOVE."},{"startMs":1617000,"endMs":1622000,"text":"HAH! ALL YOU'RE DOING IS COPYING ME, LIKE A MONKEY!"},{"startMs":1622000,"endMs":1624000,"text":"Both: YOU CAN'T BEAT ME WITH CHEAP TRICKS."},{"startMs":1624000,"endMs":1626000,"text":"I'LL CRUSH YOU."},{"startMs":1626000,"endMs":1631000,"text":"[GRUNTS] WHEN I FINISH WITH YOU, YOU'LL NEVER OPEN THAT MONKEY MOUTH AGAIN."},{"startMs":1631000,"endMs":1635000,"text":"Zabuza: YOU TIME IT PRECISELY, WAITING FOR THE RIGHT MOMENT."},{"startMs":1635000,"endMs":1637000,"text":"WHAT IS THAT?"},{"startMs":1637000,"endMs":1643000,"text":"THE INSTANT MY MIND BECOMES UNFOCUSED, YOU CREATE A NEW ILLUSION."},{"startMs":1643000,"endMs":1648000,"text":"WITH YOUR HYPNOTIC EYE, YOU INDUCE ME TO MAKE HAND SIGNS WHILE YOU ARE MAKING THE SAME SIGNS."},{"startMs":1648000,"endMs":1653000,"text":"SO YOU SEEM TO BE COPYING ME, WHEN ACTUALLY YOU'RE CONTROLLING MY MOVEMENTS."},{"startMs":1653000,"endMs":1658000,"text":"WATER STYLE, GIANT VORTEX JUTSU!"},{"startMs":1666000,"endMs":1667000,"text":"IMPOSSIBLE!"},{"startMs":1667000,"endMs":1671000,"text":"AHHH!"},{"startMs":1671000,"endMs":1675000,"text":"NOW THAT I KNOW THIS, A VERY SIMPLE PLAN CAN DEFEAT YOU."},{"startMs":1675000,"endMs":1680000,"text":"FIRST, NEUTRALIZE YOUR PIERCING EYE WITH ZERO VISIBILITY MIST."},{"startMs":1680000,"endMs":1682000,"text":"HUH? OOF!"},{"startMs":1682000,"endMs":1683000,"text":"UNH!"},{"startMs":1683000,"endMs":1685000,"text":"[THINKING] THE MIST IS SLOWING MY REACTION TIME!"},{"startMs":1685000,"endMs":1692000,"text":"[CHUCKLING] NEXT, NEUTRALIZE YOUR HYPNOTIC EYE BY KEEPING MY OWN EYES CLOSED."},{"startMs":1692000,"endMs":1696000,"text":"YOU CAN'T BORE INTO MY MIND IF YOU CAN'T LOOK INTO MY EYES."},{"startMs":1696000,"endMs":1702000,"text":"BRILLIANT, EXCEPT, WITH YOUR EYES CLOSED, YOU CAN'T SEE ME, EITHER."},{"startMs":1702000,"endMs":1704000,"text":"HAVE YOU FORGOTTEN WHO I AM, KAKASHI?"},{"startMs":1704000,"endMs":1708000,"text":"I'M THE DEMON OF THE HIDDEN MIST, MASTER OF THE SILENT KILL."},{"startMs":1708000,"endMs":1710000,"text":"I CAN TAKE YOU