E HUMAN EYE CANNOT TRACK MY MOVEMENTS. IT MUST HAVE BEEN A COINCIDENCE."},{"startMs":2470000,"endMs":2475000,"text":"[GASPS] NARUTO, RUN FOR IT! HUH? GET OUT OF HERE AND ATTACK FROM THE OUTSIDE! HURRY!"},{"startMs":2506000,"endMs":2508000,"text":"UH, ALL RIGHT. YOU GOT IT!"},{"startMs":2508000,"endMs":2513000,"text":"[GRUNTING] YOU CANNOT ESCAPE."},{"startMs":2623000,"endMs":2624000,"text":"[GRUNTING] AHH! UNH! UGH. OOF! [GRUNTING] YOU THINK YOU CAN KEEP ME HERE? FORGET IT! THAT'S IT! FIRE STYLE! FIREBALL JUTSU! UNH! OOF! UGH! [NARUTO PANTING] I COULDN'T GET PAST HIM. THAT WAS GOOD, NARUTO. HUH? [GRUNTS] ONCE AGAIN? YEAH, LET'S DO IT! [THINKING] THERE MUST BE A LIMIT TO HIS CHAKRA, TOO. I CAN FEEL HIM SLOWING DOWN. AHHH! [FOOTSTEPS] [THINKING] NO MORE GAMES. I NEED TO STOP THIS NOW. THIS TIME, YOU'LL STAY DOWN. ARGH! UGH! AHHH! UH? SASUKE! AHH! [THINKING] AN ENEMY YOU CAN'T SEE AND CAN'T HEAR. [GROWLS] IT'S BEEN A LONG TIME SINCE I FACED ANYONE THIS TOUGH. AND SASUKE AND NARUTO-- I DON'T KNOW IF THEY CAN HOLD OUT. STAY CALM. THINK. WHERE WILL HE STRIKE? OH! THE BRIDGE BUILDER!"},{"startMs":2624000,"endMs":2625000,"text":"[GRUNTS] [BOTH GASP] [GRUNTS] TOO LATE! [SLICING] [GIRL FAINTLY SCREAMING] ♪ HUH ♪ Naruto: WHY? WHY THIS? WHY DID THIS HAPPEN? I NEVER ASKED YOU TO COVER FOR ME. I HATED YOU! YET YOU PUT YOUR LIFE ON THE LINE FOR ME. ■■ WHY? I WON'T FORGIVE YOU! CAPTIONED BY THE NATIONAL CAPTIONING INSTITUTE --www.ncicap.org-- ?■ó?O@Ñ■Ñ■ç■ç■Ñ■Ñ■Ñ?ç■ç■S#■8 !!? [thinking] He's faster than before... Whatage. ... r Shadow Clone Jutsu! [heavy metal guitar]■■ [blowing sound] Aahhh!!! [thinking] I got him that time!... I'm starting to get the timing! Rrrrrr!!! [thinking] He read my movements, but that's not possible. I was close, but I couldn't get to him! Naruto... Can you do it again? Huh? Of course! Nothing can stop me, believe it! [thinking] He doesn't want to show it, but he's exhausted, the Shadow Clone jutsu uses up so much chakra. But thanks to him, I figured it ou