fying nothing..."},{"startMs":4514000,"endMs":4516000,"text":"Yeah, well, speak for yourself."},{"startMs":4516000,"endMs":4520000,"text":"Are you really that blind little one? I am speaking of myself."},{"startMs":4520000,"endMs":4524000,"text":"This day has shown that I am no longer of any use to Zabuza."},{"startMs":4524000,"endMs":4527000,"text":"Zabuza. Why that guy, anyway?!"},{"startMs":4527000,"endMs":4531000,"text":"To devote your life to a rotten skunk who doesn't know the meaning of the word honor!"},{"startMs":4531000,"endMs":4538000,"text":"If he's really the one person that matters to you, Man, that's the sorriest thing I've ever heard."},{"startMs":4538000,"endMs":4543000,"text":"There were once others who mattered to me... long ago..."},{"startMs":4544000,"endMs":4549000,"text":"My father... and my mother..."},{"startMs":4550000,"endMs":4557000,"text":"I was born in the Land of Water, in a small village where the snow lies deep in the winter..."},{"startMs":4557000,"endMs":4559000,"text":"My parents were famers and very poor."},{"startMs":4559000,"endMs":4562000,"text":"Our life was hard, but we were content."},{"startMs":4562000,"endMs":4566000,"text":"My parents were good to each other, and kind to me..."},{"startMs":4566000,"endMs":4571000,"text":"Yes, we were happy once... But then everything changed."},{"startMs":4612000,"endMs":4613000,"text":"Because of something SOUP...YOUR MOUTH WILL GO CRAZY."},{"startMs":4613000,"endMs":4620000,"text":"♪ IT'S THE SOUP WITH TONS OF FANS ♪ ♪ IN THAT RED AND WHITE CAN ♪ ♪ ONE SLURP AND YOU'LL UNDERSTAND ♪"},{"startMs":4620000,"endMs":4623000,"text":"♪ CAMPBELL'S CHICKEN NOODLE MANIA ♪ COOL!"},{"startMs":4623000,"endMs":4628000,"text":"Announcer: CAMPBELL'S SOUPS WITH LESS SODIUM. M'M! M'M! GOOD!"},{"startMs":4709000,"endMs":4711000,"text":"COOL!"},{"startMs":4711000,"endMs":4715000,"text":"long before I was even born. Everything changed."},{"startMs":4715000,"endMs":4719000,"text":"What do you mean? What was it, what happened?"},{"startMs":4719000,"endMs":4724000,"text":"It wasn't my doing..."},{"startMs":4724000,"endMs":4726000,"text":"It is in the blood."},{"startMs":4726000,"endMs":4729000,"text":"Blood?"},{"startMs":4729000,"endMs":4731000,"text":"So what was it?"},{"startMs":4731000,"endMs":4735000,"text":"You said something happened that changed everything."},{"startMs":4735000,"endMs":4738000,"text":"It was... my father who changed."},{"startMs":4738000,"endMs":4743000,"text":"(Haku) He killed my mother and he almost killed me. (Naruto) Huh?!"},{"startMs":4743000,"endMs":4750000,"text":"After years of suffering the horrors of civil war, the people of my land had come to fear and hate anyone"},{"startMs":4750000,"endMs":4752000,"text":"who carried the Kekkei Genkai in their blood."},{"startMs":4752000,"endMs":4755000,"text":"(Naruto) K■kkei Genkai?"},{"startMs":4755000,"endMs":4763000,"text":"(Haku) The advanced bloodline trait of a clan, its jutsu and abilities passed down from generation to generation."},{"startMs":4763000,"endMs":4767000,"text":"Because of their unique abilities, the clans were used as mercenaries."},{"startMs":4767000,"endMs":4771000,"text":"They fought in many battles and were much feared."},{"startMs":4771000,"endMs":4778000,"text":"But when the wars were over, they were despised and shunned by the people, who feared their presence would only bring more war and misfortune."},{"startMs":4781000,"endMs":4790000,"text":"So it was that after the wars these clans went into hiding, denying the bloodline trait that flowed in their veins..."},{"startMs":4790000,"endMs":4792000,"text":"...concealing their unique abilities..."},{"startMs":4792000,"endMs":4796000,"text":"Knowing that to be discovered meant certain death."},{"startMs":4796000,"endMs":4801000,"text":"If you had searched that boy's memories, I'm sure you would have found it there, too..."},{"startMs":4801000,"endMs":4807000,"text":"...the cruelty of people, their fear of things they don't understand."},{"startMs":4807000,"endMs":4811000,"text":"For years my mother was successful in hiding her bloodline trait."},{"startMs":4811000,"endMs":4814000,"text":"She met and fell in love with a simple farmer..."},{"startMs":4814000,"endMs":4816000,"text":"And they were married."},{"startMs":4816000,"endMs":4820000,"text":"And after that my mother thought she would lead a peaceful, ordinary life to the end of her days."},{"startMs":4820000,"endMs":4824000,"text":"[laughing] Mama! Look what I can do!"},{"startMs":4824000,"endMs":4826000,"text":"Oh!!!"},{"startMs":4826000,"endMs":4830000,"text":"Ha-ha!... See what I made? See?"},{"startMs":4830000,"endMs":4833000,"text":"Isn't it beautiful?"},{"startMs":4833000,"endMs":4835000,"text":"No! You must never! Do you hear?! Never!"},{"startMs":4835000,"endMs":4837000,"text":"You wicked, wicked child!"},{"startMs":4837000,"endMs":4841000,"text":"Mama? What is it? Stop, Mama!"},{"startMs":4841000,"endMs":4847000,"text":"[hard slap] (mother) Oh, I'm sorry..."},{"startMs":4847000,"endMs":4852000,"text":"[crying] I'm sorry, my darling, I'm sorry."},{"startMs":4853000,"endMs":4855000,"text":"(Haku) My father had seen..."},{"startMs":4855000,"endMs":4860000,"text":"And so he knew our secret, my mother's and mine."},{"startMs":4860000,"endMs":4869000,"text":"[shattering crash] [whimpering]"},{"startMs":4869000,"endMs":4881000,"text":"[crying] Aahhh!!!"},{"startMs":4881000,"endMs":4908000,"text":"[crash] [footsteps on snow] [crying]"},{"startMs":4921000,"endMs":4923000,"text":"When at last I was myself again."},{"startMs":4923000,"endMs":4926000,"text":"I was no longer myself..."},{"startMs":4926000,"endMs":4929000,"text":"My father and mother were gone..."},{"startMs":4929000,"endMs":4935000,"text":"But I knew that something else had been taken from me, something even more important."},{"startMs":4935000,"endMs":4939000,"text":"And that is when I truly despaired."},{"startMs":4939000,"endMs":4942000,"text":"More important than your mother and father?"},{"startMs":4942000,"endMs":4945000,"text":"What? My purpose..."},{"startMs":4945000,"endMs":4948000,"text":"In all the world, there was no one who needed me."},{"startMs":4948000,"endMs":4951000,"text":"I was... unnecessary."},{"startMs":4951000,"endMs":4954000,"text":"[thinking] Just like me!"},{"startMs":4954000,"endMs":4958000,"text":"Why is it you're so determined to be Hokage?"},{"startMs":4958000,"endMs":4963000,"text":"Because you want all eyes in your village to look on you and recognize you as a great ninja."},{"startMs":4963000,"endMs":4967000,"text":"You see, it is only through the eyes of others that our little lives have any significance."},{"startMs":4967000,"endMs":4974000,"text":"When there is no one who sees you, or will even look at you it's as if you do not exist."},{"startMs":4974000,"endMs":4978000,"text":"Then Zabuza came along and looked at me, and his eyes were not full of hate or fear."},{"startMs":4978000,"endMs":4982000,"text":"He did not shun me for my strangeness."},{"startMs":4982000,"endMs":4985000,"text":"Indeed, my special powers were just what he wanted."},{"startMs":4985000,"endMs":4989000,"text":"He made me necessary again."},{"startMs":4989000,"endMs":4993000,"text":"Huh! Little kid like you... with no one to look after you..."},{"startMs":4993000,"endMs":4998000,"text":"You'll die a beggar's death."},{"startMs":5000000,"endMs":5005000,"text":"Hey know what? Your eyes remind me of mine."},{"startMs":5010000,"endMs":5016000,"text":"Well, little one? Will you stay here and die or come with me and be of some use?"},{"startMs":5016000,"endMs":5021000,"text":"Will you serve me and submit to my will in all things?"},{"startMs":5033000,"endMs":5040000,"text":"Then your special abilities belong to me from this day forward."},{"startMs":5052000,"endMs":5057000,"text":"Let us go then."},{"startMs":5060000,"endMs":5063000,"text":"I was happy."},{"startMs":5063000,"endMs":5065000,"text":"My time here is done, Haku."},{"startMs":5065000,"endMs":5070000,"text":"Tonight I cast aside the Land of Water..."},{"startMs":5070000,"endMs":5075000,"text":"One day I will return, and seize this land and hold it in my hands..."},{"startMs":5075000,"endMs":5081000,"text":"Many things must be done before that day comes, and you will help me to do them."},{"startMs":5081000,"endMs":5088000,"text":"But I warn you... friendship, comfort, encouragement, I do not need these things, nor should you expect them from me."},{"startMs":5088000,"endMs":5090000,"text":"I understand."},{"startMs":5090000,"endMs":5092000,"text":"I am yours, Zabuza."},{"startMs":5092000,"endMs":5094000,"text":"I am only an instrument of your will."},{"startMs":5094000,"endMs":5099000,"text":"Think of me as a weapon to be kept at your side and used as you see fit."},{"startMs":5101000,"endMs":5104000,"text":"Well said, child."},{"startMs":5104000,"endMs":5107000,"text":"I have failed you, Zabuza..."},{"startMs":5107000,"endMs":5112000,"text":"I am like a weapon that has been broken and is of no further use."},{"startMs":5115000,"endMs":5120000,"text":"Huh!... Ah-ah!"},{"startMs":5123000,"endMs":5126000,"text":"Naruto..."},{"startMs":5126000,"endMs":5131000,"text":"Kill me..."},{"startMs":5132000,"endMs":5247000,"text":"Ninja Art! [struggling] PEANUT BUTTER POPS ARE AWESOME."},{"startMs":5247000,"endMs":5248000,"text":"WHAT?"},{"startMs":5248000,"endMs":5251000,"text":"I REALLY WISH YOU WOULDN'T 1AT THOSE IN FRONT OF US."},{"startMs":5251000,"endMs":5256000,"text":"[ sighs ] [ Male Announcer ] NEW CHOCOLATE PEANUT BUTTER POPS CEREAL."},{"startMs":5256000,"endMs":5261000,"text":"PART OF THIS BALANCED BREAKFAST."},{"startMs":5304000,"endMs":5309000,"text":"Earth Style Fanged Pursuit Jutsu!"},{"startMs":5312000,"endMs":5314000,"text":"(Zabuza) I don't know why you bother."},{"startMs":5314000,"endMs":5318000,"text":"Of what use is your Jutsu if you can't even find me?..."},{"startMs":5318000,"endMs":5323000,"text":"But I can find you."},{"startMs":5323000,"endMs":5328000,"text":"Blindly falling into my trap. You disappoint me, Kakashi."},{"startMs":5328000,"endMs":5330000,"text":"I think you're right."},{"startMs":5330000,"endMs":5334000,"text":"It is time to put an end to this."},{"startMs":5334000,"endMs":5335000,"text":"Huh?!"},{"startMs":5335000,"endMs":5339000,"text":"[eathquake rumble] Uh?!"},{"startMs":5339000,"endMs":5340000,"text":"[growl] Aahhh!!!"},{"startMs":5340000,"endMs":5342000,"text":"Aahhh!!!"},{"startMs":5342000,"endMs":5349000,"text":"[dogs barking] That dredful noise, what could it be?..."},{"startMs":5349000,"endMs":5354000,"text":"I don't know and I'm not sure that I want to find out..."},{"startMs":5356000,"endMs":5361000,"text":"I realized, if I couldn't see you, I'd have to smell you out..."},{"startMs":5361000,"endMs":5364000,"text":"■■ That was a summoning Jutsu."},{"startMs":5364000,"endMs":5366000,"text":"I was calling forth my ninja hounds."},{"startMs":5366000,"endMs":5370000,"text":"They can track a scent anywhere."},{"startMs":5370000,"endMs":5374000,"text":"When you attacked me, I let you get past my guard."},{"startMs":5374000,"endMs":5377000,"text":"I wanted you to cut me..."},{"startMs":5377000,"endMs":5381000,"text":"You see, it's the smell of my blood on your blade that led them to you..."},{"startMs":5381000,"endMs":5382000,"text":"Surprised?"},{"startMs":5382000,"endMs":5386000,"text":"Looks like I wasn't the only one who was blind."},{"startMs":5386000,"endMs":5391000,"text":"Hm! Falling into my trap... You disappoint me, Zabuza."},{"startMs":5393000,"endMs":5395000,"text":"Ah, the mist is finally clearing..."},{"startMs":5395000,"endMs":5398000,"text":"And you know what I see?"},{"startMs":5398000,"endMs":5401000,"text":"Your death."},{"startMs":5401000,"endMs":5402000,"text":"(Zabuza) Talk, talk. Do you mean to talk me to death?"},{"startMs":5402000,"endMs":5405000,"text":"(Sasuke) In a way, yes."},{"startMs":5405000,"endMs":5407000,"text":"Right now my hounds are just playing with you."},{"startMs":5407000,"endMs":5412000,"text":"But one word from me and they'll tear you apart."},{"startMs":5413000,"endMs":5417000,"text":"Poor Zabuza, see where your ambition's got you?"},{"startMs":5417000,"endMs":5419000,"text":"You were always pushing things too far."},{"startMs":5419000,"endMs":5431000,"text":"[metal crash] (Sasuke) There was the failed Mizukage assassination"},{"startMs":5431000,"endMs":5434000,"text":"and your attempted coup d' etat."},{"startMs":5434000,"endMs":5439000,"text":"You were forced to flee with the few followers you had, your country's tracker ninja hot on your heels."},{"startMs":5439000,"endMs":5447000,"text":"You became a rogue ninja whose name was quickly known, even in the Village Hidden in the Leaves..."},{"startMs":5447000,"endMs":5450000,"text":"Now your crazy enough to want to go back and try it again."},{"startMs":5450000,"endMs":5452000,"text":"But for that you need money."},{"startMs":5452000,"endMs":5458000,"text":"And to get it ■■ you've stooped slow as to be the hired thug of a swine like Gato."},{"startMs":5458000,"endMs":5461000,"text":"All right, Zabuza, enough talk."},{"startMs":5461000,"endMs":5463000,"text":"Time to finish it."},{"startMs":5463000,"endMs":5467000,"text":"But it won't be with Sharingan... imitations of some other ninja's tricks."},{"startMs":5467000,"endMs":5471000,"text":"No, it's time I introduced you to..."},{"startMs":5471000,"endMs":5476000,"text":"...my own Jutsu."},{"startMs":5477000,"endMs":5488000,"text":"[crackling electrical sounds] Lightning... Blade!"},{"startMs":5488000,"endMs":5491000,"text":"His chakra is so strong it's visible!"},{"startMs":5491000,"endMs":5496000,"text":"He holds it in his hand!"},{"startMs":5496000,"endMs":5499000,"text":"I won't allow you to kill Tazuna."},{"startMs":5499000,"endMs":5502000,"text":"He's a brave man with a noble dream."},{"startMs":5502000,"endMs":5506000,"text":"The bridge he's building is the hope of this land and and all its people."},{"startMs":5506000,"endMs":5508000,"text":"You're like a disease."},{"startMs":5508000,"endMs":5513000,"text":"By attacking one you infect all. And you don't care."},{"startMs":5513000,"endMs":5516000,"text":"That is not the way of the Shinobi."},{"startMs":5516000,"endMs":5520000,"text":"You're right, I don't care."},{"startMs":5520000,"endMs":5523000,"text":"These useless little people and their petty little dreams."},{"startMs":5523000,"endMs":5526000,"text":"Why should they matter to me?"},{"startMs":5526000,"endMs":5530000,"text":"I have a dream of my own!"},{"startMs":5530000,"endMs":5535000,"text":"But to have a dream, you need to have a future."},{"startMs":5535000,"endMs":5539000,"text":"You don't."},{"startMs":5539000,"endMs":5544000,"text":"Your future's all used up, Zabuza."},{"startMs":5544000,"endMs":5547000,"text":"(Haku) Go on. Strike."},{"startMs":5547000,"endMs":5549000,"text":"Kill me..."},{"startMs":5549000,"endMs":5551000,"text":"Why do you hesitate?"},{"startMs":5551000,"endMs":5553000,"text":"Uh-uhhh!!!"},{"startMs":5553000,"endMs":5557000,"text":"That's the most ridiculous story I've ever heard!"},{"startMs":5557000,"endMs":5560000,"text":"I mean, he treats you like a slave!"},{"startMs":5560000,"endMs":5562000,"text":"You're a human being, not a weapon or a tool."},{"startMs":5562000,"endMs":5567000,"text":"How can you care about someone like that?"},{"startMs":5567000,"endMs":5568000,"text":"For that very reason."},{"startMs":5568000,"endMs":5570000,"text":"Huh??"},{"startMs":5570000,"endMs":5573000,"text":"Does that seem so strange to you?"},{"startMs":5573000,"endMs":5576000,"text":"Well, yeah... A little."},{"startMs":5576000,"endMs":5581000,"text":"When he found me I was without a purpose or reason for living."},{"startMs":5581000,"endMs":5584000,"text":"Zabuza gave me both."},{"startMs":5584000,"endMs":5592000,"text":"[peaceful flute] [soft laughter]"},{"startMs":5592000,"endMs":5597000,"text":"Oh-oh-huh?!"},{"startMs":5602000,"endMs":5607000,"text":"Huh-uh!"},{"startMs":5614000,"endMs":5620000,"text":"But now, my usefulness is over, the only thing that gave my life meaning."},{"startMs":5620000,"endMs":5627000,"text":"It's gone. I'm a broken tool, a blunted weapon of no use to anyone."},{"startMs":5628000,"endMs":5633000,"text":"Go on, Naruto. Do it. For both of our sakes."},{"startMs":5634000,"endMs":5636000,"text":"Do it..."},{"startMs":5636000,"endMs":5641000,"text":"Quickly."},{"startMs":5643000,"endMs":5651000,"text":"(Naruto) Look, it's not as if I like Haku, not after what he did to Sasuke, but to kill him, in cold blood!"},{"startMs":5651000,"endMs":5655000,"text":"What do I do? What would a Hokage do?"},{"startMs":5655000,"endMs":5660000,"text":"If only I could have had a straight up fight, like Kakashi and Zabuza!"},{"startMs":5660000,"endMs":5664000,"text":"I mean hey, I'm just a kid How come I always have to make the tough decisions?"},{"startMs":5664000,"endMs":5669000,"text":"What would the other guys do?"},{"startMs":5734000,"endMs":5739000,"text":"ó?"},{"startMs":5745000,"endMs":5749000,"text":"!!? [thinking] He's faster than before... Whatage."},{"startMs":5749000,"endMs":5750000,"text":"..."},{"startMs":5750000,"endMs":5755000,"text":"r Shadow Clone Jutsu!"},{"startMs":5778000,"endMs":5802000,"text":"[heavy metal guitar] [running breaths]"},{"startMs":5806000,"endMs":5812000,"text":"Naruto and the others are fighting risking their lives while we do nothing!"},{"startMs":5812000,"endMs":5816000,"text":"We've got to fight too!"},{"startMs":5816000,"endMs":5824000,"text":"(Naruto) The Weapons Known as Shinobi Uncle Giichi!"},{"startMs":5824000,"endMs":5828000,"text":"Uncle Giichi, hurry! Come to the bridge with me!"},{"startMs":5828000,"endMs":5830000,"text":"We don't have to hide!"},{"startMs":5830000,"endMs":5838000,"text":"If we fight together we can take Gato down, I know it!"},{"startMs":5840000,"endMs":5841000,"text":"(Giichi) No, Inari."},{"startMs":5841000,"endMs":5842000,"text":"I've given up fighting."},{"startMs":5842000,"endMs":5847000,"text":"Fighting is for heroes like your father..."},{"startMs":5847000,"endMs":5852000,"text":"You see what good it did him. Isn't one dead hero enough?"},{"startMs":5858000,"endMs":5864000,"text":"What will more fighting bring us, but more fallen heroes and more regrets?..."},{"startMs":5864000,"endMs":5865000,"text":"No, Inari..."},{"startMs":5865000,"endMs":5868000,"text":"My heart is already full of enough regrets..."},{"startMs":5868000,"endMs":5873000,"text":"to last a lifetime."},{"startMs":5874000,"endMs":5888000,"text":"[acoustic guitar] I don't want to live a life of regrets either..."},{"startMs":5888000,"endMs":5891000,"text":"That's why we've got to fight!"},{"startMs":5891000,"endMs":5896000,"text":"Live your life so you have nothing to regret."},{"startMs":5897000,"endMs":5900000,"text":"I know you care about everyone, and so do I!"},{"startMs":5900000,"endMs":5902000,"text":"You and Mother and Grandfather!"},{"startMs":5902000,"endMs":5907000,"text":"That's why we have to fight!"},{"startMs":5910000,"endMs":5912000,"text":"All my life I've been a coward."},{"startMs":5912000,"endMs":5920000,"text":"But now I know that hiding from things that we're afraid of doesn't make them go away."},{"startMs":5925000,"endMs":5939000,"text":"[flute] (Inari) Come to the bridge!"},{"startMs":5939000,"endMs":5943000,"text":"Our little Inari's become a man."},{"startMs":5943000,"endMs":5945000,"text":"And you, dear?"},{"startMs":5945000,"endMs":5950000,"text":"You sure you want to send him alone?"},{"startMs":5954000,"endMs":5961000,"text":"[door knock] Is anyone there? Hello?..."},{"startMs":5961000,"endMs":5966000,"text":"Come to the bridge with me and fight!"},{"startMs":5970000,"endMs":5971000,"text":"What do I do now?"},{"startMs":5971000,"endMs":5976000,"text":"No one will even open their door to listen."},{"startMs":5980000,"endMs":5983000,"text":"'Cuz you really are brave!"},{"startMs":5983000,"endMs":5988000,"text":"[thinking] If no one else will help..."},{"startMs":5995000,"endMs":6000000,"text":"[dogs growling] Rrrrrr!!!"},{"startMs":6004000,"endMs":6008000,"text":"Poor Zabuza, see where your ambition's got you?"},{"startMs":6008000,"endMs":6012000,"text":"You were always pushing things too far."},{"startMs":6012000,"endMs":6016000,"text":"There was the failed Mizukage assassination and your attempted coup d'etat."},{"startMs":6016000,"endMs":6023000,"text":"You were forced to flee with the followers you had, your country's tracker ninja hot on your heels."},{"startMs":6023000,"endMs":6031000,"text":"You became a Rogue Ninja whose name was known even in the Village Hidden in the Leaves..."},{"startMs":6031000,"endMs":6033000,"text":"You're crazy enough to want to try it again."},{"startMs":6033000,"endMs":6035000,"text":"But you need money."},{"startMs":6035000,"endMs":6043000,"text":"And to get it you've stooped so low as to be the hired thug of a swine like Gato."},{"startMs":6043000,"endMs":6045000,"text":"All right Zabuza, enough talk."},{"startMs":6045000,"endMs":6046000,"text":"Time to finish it."},{"startMs":6046000,"endMs":6052000,"text":"But it won't be with Sharingan, imitations of some other ninja's tricks."},{"startMs":6052000,"endMs":6055000,"text":"No, it's time I introduced you to..."},{"startMs":6055000,"endMs":6060000,"text":"...my own Jutsu."},{"startMs":6069000,"endMs":6072000,"text":"Lightning Blade!"},{"startMs":6072000,"endMs":6075000,"text":"His chakra is so strong it's visible!"},{"startMs":6075000,"endMs":6080000,"text":"He holds it in his hand!"},{"startMs":6080000,"endMs":6084000,"text":"I won't allow you to kill Tazuna."},{"startMs":6084000,"endMs":6086000,"text":"He's a brave man with a noble dream."},{"startMs":6086000,"endMs":6091000,"text":"The bridge he's building is the hope of this land."},{"startMs":6091000,"endMs":6096000,"text":"You're like a disease, by attacking one you infect all and you don't care."},{"startMs":6096000,"endMs":6100000,"text":"That is not the way of the Shinobi."},{"startMs":6100000,"endMs":6104000,"text":"You're right, I don't care!"},{"startMs":6104000,"endMs":6110000,"text":"These useless little people and their petty little dreams why should they matter to me?"},{"startMs":6110000,"endMs":6114000,"text":"I have my own dream!"},{"startMs":6114000,"endMs":6119000,"text":"But to have a dream, you need a future."},{"startMs":6119000,"endMs":6124000,"text":"You don't."},{"startMs":6124000,"endMs":6182000,"text":"Your future's all used up, Zabuza I CHIP THE WOLF WILL USE MY INVENTION..."},{"startMs":6182000,"endMs":6186000,"text":"TO FLY ME TO THE DELICIOUS COOKIE CRISP CEREAL."},{"startMs":6186000,"endMs":6194000,"text":"COOKIE CRISP LOOKS LIKE CHOCOLATE CHIP COOKIES, TASTES LIKE 'EM TOO, BUT IT'S A BREAKFAST CEREAL-- OFF I GO TO GET THE COOKIE CRISP!!!!"},{"startMs":6194000,"endMs":6199000,"text":"YOHAAAAA! AAAAAGH! WHOAAAA!"},{"startMs":6199000,"endMs":6200000,"text":"GOT IT!"},{"startMs":6200000,"endMs":6201000,"text":"WOAH!"},{"startMs":6201000,"endMs":6205000,"text":"AGH... JUST MISSED MY COOOKIE CRISP."},{"startMs":6205000,"endMs":6206000,"text":"COOKIE CRISP. PART OF THIS GOOD BREAKFAST..."},{"startMs":6206000,"endMs":6208000,"text":"WITH 12 KEY VITAMINS AND MINERALS."},{"startMs":6208000,"endMs":6213000,"text":"COOOOOOOKIE CRISP. NEXT TIME IT'S MINE!"},{"startMs":6242000,"endMs":6249000,"text":"♪ IT'S THE SOUP WITH TONS OF FANS ♪ ♪ IN THAT RED AND WHITE CAN ♪ ♪ ONE SLURP AND YOU'LL UNDERSTAND ♪"},{"startMs":6249000,"endMs":6253000,"text":"♪ CAMPBELL'S CHICKEN NOODLE MANIA ♪ COOL!"},{"startMs":6253000,"endMs":6256000,"text":"Announcer: CAMPBELL'S SOUPS WITH LESS SODIUM. M'M! M'M! GOOD!"},{"startMs":6256000,"endMs":6261000,"text":"COOL!"},{"startMs":6277000,"endMs":6282000,"text":"Why do you hesitate?"},{"startMs":6283000,"endMs":6288000,"text":"Thought you wanted to be a warrior."},{"startMs":6289000,"endMs":6291000,"text":"It's not abouthat."},{"startMs":6291000,"endMs":6299000,"text":"Do you believe that's everything, just fighting and killing 'til one man is left standing?!"},{"startMs":6299000,"endMs":6302000,"text":"There's more to being Shinobi than that."},{"startMs":6302000,"endMs":6308000,"text":"There are other ways of showing strength than by beating someone in battle."},{"startMs":6308000,"endMs":6312000,"text":"I've had a feeling all along, from the moment we met..."},{"startMs":6312000,"endMs":6313000,"text":"We're a lot a like."},{"startMs":6313000,"endMs":6316000,"text":"Huh?!"},{"startMs":6316000,"endMs":6320000,"text":"I'm sure you know what I mean."},{"startMs":6320000,"endMs":6325000,"text":"I'm sorry that it must be your hand that's tainted with my blood."},{"startMs":6325000,"endMs":6328000,"text":"Sure about this?"},{"startMs":6328000,"endMs":6332000,"text":"And you're positive that it's the only way?"},{"startMs":6332000,"endMs":6333000,"text":"Yes."},{"startMs":6333000,"endMs":6337000,"text":"Uhhh!!!"},{"startMs":6337000,"endMs":6345000,"text":"If we'd met in another time and place I think that maybe we could've been friends."},{"startMs":6349000,"endMs":6354000,"text":"Yes, that's right... Hold fast to your dreams."},{"startMs":6354000,"endMs":6359000,"text":"This is for Sasuke... Because he also had a dream!"},{"startMs":6363000,"endMs":6367000,"text":"Aahhh!!!"},{"startMs":6367000,"endMs":6372000,"text":"[thinking] Thank you, Naruto. Strike true."},{"startMs":6374000,"endMs":6379000,"text":"At last, I think this blasted fog is lifting."},{"startMs":6379000,"endMs":6380000,"text":"Hm?"},{"startMs":6380000,"endMs":6382000,"text":"Look, they're standing still."},{"startMs":6382000,"endMs":6384000,"text":"Like they're squaring off."},{"startMs":6384000,"endMs":6387000,"text":"(Tazuna) I can't see a thing."},{"startMs":6387000,"endMs":6390000,"text":"Which one of them ís Kakashieni?"},{"startMs":6390000,"endMs":6395000,"text":"One's moving!"},{"startMs":6396000,"endMs":6397000,"text":"Hu!"},{"startMs":6397000,"endMs":6402000,"text":"Aahhh!!!"},{"startMs":6403000,"endMs":6407000,"text":"Huh?!"},{"startMs":6407000,"endMs":6412000,"text":"Sorry, Naruto. Change of plan."},{"startMs":6417000,"endMs":6422000,"text":"I'm not ready die quite yet."},{"startMs":6433000,"endMs":6437000,"text":"[thinking] Is this the end?"},{"startMs":6437000,"endMs":6442000,"text":"Aahhh!!! Yeah!"},{"startMs":6444000,"endMs":6448000,"text":"Huh, huh?!"},{"startMs":6448000,"endMs":6456000,"text":"[explosion] What the devil?!"},{"startMs":6457000,"endMs":6462000,"text":"Huh?!"},{"startMs":6481000,"endMs":6483000,"text":"Huh?!"},{"startMs":6483000,"endMs":6509000,"text":"[glass shattering] [cough]"},{"startMs":6509000,"endMs":6514000,"text":"Za-bu-za..."},{"startMs":6514000,"endMs":6518000,"text":"So, my future is all used up, eh?"},{"startMs":6518000,"endMs":6521000,"text":"Ha-ha-ha-ha!..."},{"startMs":6521000,"endMs":6526000,"text":"Wrong again, Kakashi."},{"startMs":6625000,"endMs":6628000,"text":"OKAY, AT THE COUNT OF THREE, EVERYBODY IN!"},{"startMs":6628000,"endMs":6629000,"text":"EVERYBODY?"},{"startMs":6629000,"endMs":6630000,"text":"Kids: EVERYBODY, RONALD!"},{"startMs":6630000,"endMs":6631000,"text":"OKAY."},{"startMs":6631000,"endMs":6633000,"text":"1... 2... 3!"},{"startMs":6633000,"endMs":6636000,"text":"( splash ) WOO HOO!"},{"startMs":6636000,"endMs":6637000,"text":"I TOLD YOU IT WAS NO BIG DEAL."},{"startMs":6637000,"endMs":6646000,"text":"♪♪ I CAN JOIN THE LEGION,"},{"startMs":6646000,"endMs":6648000,"text":"NOW THAT LEGION OF SUPER HEROES ACTION-PACKED ADVENTURES..."},{"startMs":6648000,"endMs":6650000,"text":"ARE AT McDONALD'S."},{"startMs":6650000,"endMs":6651000,"text":"THERE'S ONE IN MY HAPPY MEAL."},{"startMs":6651000,"endMs":6662000,"text":"♪♪ This (Guy) Severe Leaf Hurricanes!"},{"startMs":6662000,"endMs":6667000,"text":"You're not going to the bridge by yourself."},{"startMs":6668000,"endMs":6672000,"text":"I have to go by myself, no one will come with me."},{"startMs":6672000,"endMs":6675000,"text":"I have no choice."},{"startMs":6675000,"endMs":6680000,"text":"You shouldn't go at all."},{"startMs":6687000,"endMs":6689000,"text":"Stop this!"},{"startMs":6689000,"endMs":6692000,"text":"You're only a child, what can you do?"},{"startMs":6692000,"endMs":6694000,"text":"You're right, I'm just a kid..."},{"startMs":6694000,"endMs":6699000,"text":"But I know what it means to stand and fight."},{"startMs":6699000,"endMs":6704000,"text":"I'm my father's kid."},{"startMs":6707000,"endMs":6711000,"text":"Kaiza..."},{"startMs":6711000,"endMs":6713000,"text":"No! Inari,wait!"},{"startMs":6713000,"endMs":6718000,"text":"Hm?"},{"startMs":6718000,"endMs":6722000,"text":"Huh? What? Where'd he go?"},{"startMs":6722000,"endMs":6724000,"text":"Huh?"},{"startMs":6724000,"endMs":6727000,"text":"Hey!"},{"startMs":6727000,"endMs":6731000,"text":"The fog's lifting..."},{"startMs":6731000,"endMs":6735000,"text":"Wait... Is that him?"},{"startMs":6735000,"endMs":6740000,"text":"Heahhh!!!"},{"startMs":6740000,"endMs":6749000,"text":"[synthesizer] What?"},{"startMs":6749000,"endMs":6754000,"text":"I don't get it, what's going on?"},{"startMs":6758000,"endMs":6762000,"text":"Isn't that the young man in the mask?"},{"startMs":6762000,"endMs":6767000,"text":"The boy threw himself in front of my attack!"},{"startMs":6770000,"endMs":6772000,"text":"He saved your worthless life..."},{"startMs":6772000,"endMs":6777000,"text":"at the cost of his own."},{"startMs":6778000,"endMs":6783000,"text":"Well done,Haku."},{"startMs":6784000,"endMs":6787000,"text":"Aahhh!!!"},{"startMs":6787000,"endMs":6789000,"text":"Kakashi-sensei, watch out!!!"},{"startMs":6789000,"endMs":6794000,"text":"He'd hack through the boy to take me down?"},{"startMs":6794000,"endMs":6797000,"text":"I knew I'd found a treasure when I'd found you, boy!..."},{"startMs":6797000,"endMs":6802000,"text":"You've not only given me my life, but Kakashi's as well!"},{"startMs":6802000,"endMs":6807000,"text":"Eahhh!!!"},{"startMs":6810000,"endMs":6812000,"text":"My time here is done, Haku..."},{"startMs":6812000,"endMs":6816000,"text":"Tonight I cast aside the Land of Water..."},{"startMs":6816000,"endMs":6821000,"text":"One day I will return, seize this land and hold it in my hands..."},{"startMs":6821000,"endMs":6826000,"text":"Many things must be done before then, and you will help me."},{"startMs":6826000,"endMs":6827000,"text":"But I warn you..."},{"startMs":6827000,"endMs":6835000,"text":"friendship, comfort, encouragement, I do not need these things, nor should you expect them from me."},{"startMs":6835000,"endMs":6837000,"text":"I understand."},{"startMs":6837000,"endMs":6838000,"text":"I am yours, Zabuza."},{"startMs":6838000,"endMs":6840000,"text":"I am an instrument of your will."},{"startMs":6840000,"endMs":6848000,"text":"Think of me as a weapon to be used as you see fit."},{"startMs":6848000,"endMs":6853000,"text":"Well said, child."},{"startMs":6857000,"endMs":6861000,"text":"Aahhh!!!"},{"startMs":6861000,"endMs":6866000,"text":"Ah!"},{"startMs":6867000,"endMs":6872000,"text":"Not bad for having a corpse in your arms."},{"startMs":6872000,"endMs":6873000,"text":"You'll gonna pay!"},{"startMs":6873000,"endMs":6878000,"text":"No!... Stay out of this, Naruto."},{"startMs":6898000,"endMs":6903000,"text":"This is my battle... Zabuza's mine!"},{"startMs":6907000,"endMs":6909000,"text":"Naruto!"},{"startMs":6909000,"endMs":6912000,"text":"(Sakura) Naruto! Over here!"},{"startMs":6912000,"endMs":6914000,"text":"Naruto!"},{"startMs":6914000,"endMs":6915000,"text":"[thinking] Sakura..."},{"startMs":6915000,"endMs":6920000,"text":"So you and Sasuke are all right?"},{"startMs":6922000,"endMs":6926000,"text":"What's wrong? Where is Sasuke anyway?"},{"startMs":6926000,"endMs":6930000,"text":"Uh... uh..."},{"startMs":6930000,"endMs":6934000,"text":"No..."},{"startMs":6934000,"endMs":6937000,"text":"Sakura..."},