7097000,"text":"♪ THAT'S SO... HUBBA BUBBA ♪ ♪ ♪"},{"startMs":7097000,"endMs":7099000,"text":"MY GREATEST CREATION!"},{"startMs":7099000,"endMs":7101000,"text":"CHOCOLATE AND VANILLA FLAVORS..."},{"startMs":7101000,"endMs":7102000,"text":"TOGETHER!"},{"startMs":7102000,"endMs":7107000,"text":"[ electricity crackles ] GRAHHH!!"},{"startMs":7107000,"endMs":7109000,"text":"IT'S ALIVE, IT'S ALIVE!!"},{"startMs":7109000,"endMs":7113000,"text":"[ grunting ] [ chuckles ] NOT FOR LONG!"},{"startMs":7113000,"endMs":7116000,"text":"[ chomp ] [ Male Announcer ] TWO FROSTINGS. TWO FILLINGS."},{"startMs":7116000,"endMs":7117000,"text":"TWO FLAVORS IN ONE."},{"startMs":7117000,"endMs":7118000,"text":"YES!"},{"startMs":7118000,"endMs":7120000,"text":"[ Male Announcer ] NEW POP-TARTS SPLITZ."},{"startMs":7120000,"endMs":7125000,"text":"CRAAAAZY GOOD!"},{"startMs":7141000,"endMs":7144000,"text":"Heah!"},{"startMs":7144000,"endMs":7153000,"text":"[piano] Heah!"},{"startMs":7155000,"endMs":7160000,"text":"Heah!"},{"startMs":7164000,"endMs":7169000,"text":"Uh!"},{"startMs":7170000,"endMs":7172000,"text":"His body's cold."},{"startMs":7172000,"endMs":7177000,"text":"This isn't one of his genjutsu tricks, is it."},{"startMs":7178000,"endMs":7181000,"text":"You don't need to be brave on my account."},{"startMs":7181000,"endMs":7186000,"text":"Go ahead and let your feelings out, Sakura, it's all right."},{"startMs":7194000,"endMs":7196000,"text":"I was the best..."},{"startMs":7196000,"endMs":7199000,"text":"Aced every test at the Academy..."},{"startMs":7199000,"endMs":7201000,"text":"The perfect student."},{"startMs":7201000,"endMs":7204000,"text":"Hm?"},{"startMs":7204000,"endMs":7209000,"text":"Did you know there are more than 100 principles of Shinobi conduct?"},{"startMs":7209000,"endMs":7212000,"text":"I memorized every single one..."},{"startMs":7212000,"endMs":7215000,"text":"I loved when they tested us on them."},{"startMs":7215000,"endMs":7218000,"text":"Was my chance to show how smart I was..."},{"startMs":7218000,"endMs":7225000,"text":"I remember so clearly this one exam they asked us to explain the 25th principle..."},{"startMs":7225000,"endMs":7230000,"text":"I got it right, of course..."},{"startMs":7234000,"endMs":7240000,"text":"A shinobi never shows his feelings, no matter what the circumstances."},{"startMs":7240000,"endMs":7243000,"text":"Feelings are a weakness."},{"startMs":7243000,"endMs":7248000,"text":"that only cloud his judgment and weaken his sense of duty."},{"startMs":7251000,"endMs":7255000,"text":"Sasuke!"},{"startMs":7255000,"endMs":7259000,"text":"[thinking] Such a burden on a young girl..."},{"startMs":7259000,"endMs":7264000,"text":"If that's the Shinobi way, you can have it."},{"startMs":7272000,"endMs":7276000,"text":"Uh!... Uh!..."},{"startMs":7276000,"endMs":7279000,"text":"Aahhh!!!"},{"startMs":7279000,"endMs":7284000,"text":"Aahhh!!!"},{"startMs":7293000,"endMs":7298000,"text":"Why... why can't I keep up with him?"},{"startMs":7302000,"endMs":7305000,"text":"Aahhh!!!"},{"startMs":7305000,"endMs":7310000,"text":"Uuhhh!!!"},{"startMs":7311000,"endMs":7316000,"text":"Uuhhh!!!"},{"startMs":7317000,"endMs":7318000,"text":"Huh?!"},{"startMs":7318000,"endMs":7321000,"text":"I'll split you in half!"},{"startMs":7321000,"endMs":7324000,"text":"Aahhh!!!"},{"startMs":7324000,"endMs":7329000,"text":"Uuhhh!!!"},{"startMs":7329000,"endMs":7330000,"text":"You're falling apart."},{"startMs":7330000,"endMs":7333000,"text":"I knew you didn't have what it takes."},{"startMs":7333000,"endMs":7336000,"text":"What did you say?"},{"startMs":7336000,"endMs":7341000,"text":"You have no idea what real strength is."},{"startMs":7345000,"endMs":7347000,"text":"Well, well..."},{"startMs":7347000,"endMs":7352000,"text":"So this is how it turns out, huh?"},{"startMs":7355000,"endMs":7360000,"text":"Game over... You lose!"},{"startMs":7380000,"endMs":7384000,"text":"Huh! Uh!..."},{"startMs":7384000,"endMs":7387000,"text":"Now both of your arms are useless."},{"startMs":7387000,"endMs":7389000,"text":"What now?"},{"startMs":7389000,"endMs":7394000,"text":"(Kakashi) You can't even make hand signs."},{"startMs":7394000,"endMs":7397000,"text":"Hm?"},{"startMs":7397000,"endMs":7399000,"text":"Huh?!"},{"startMs":7399000,"endMs":7401000,"text":"Quite a job he did on you, Zabuza?"},{"startMs":7401000,"endMs":7406000,"text":"You look like yesterday's sashimi."},{"startMs":7406000,"endMs":7411000,"text":"I must say, I'm... disappointed."},{"startMs":7418000,"endMs":7423000,"text":"[heavy metal guitar] and you act like nothing happened!"},{"startMs":7423000,"endMs":7427000,"text":"Not a single tear, no sign that you feel anything at all..."},{"startMs":7427000,"endMs":7432000,"text":"I knew you were low, Zabuza, as rotten as they come but that..."},{"startMs":7432000,"endMs":7435000,"text":"Man, you're gonna pay for that. Believe it..."},{"startMs":7435000,"endMs":7440000,"text":"I only hope someone else doesn't get to you first."},{"startMs":7440000,"endMs":7590000,"text":"Next time: \"The Demon in the Snow\" Naruto, @d You"},{"startMs":7598000,"endMs":7627000,"text":"[heavy metal guitar] Gato? I don't understand, what is all this?"},{"startMs":7627000,"endMs":7632000,"text":"Why are you here, and who are these thugs you've brought with you?"},{"startMs":7632000,"endMs":7637000,"text":"Hm. Well, you see, there's been a slight change in plan."},{"startMs":7637000,"endMs":7643000,"text":"According to the new plan, you die right here on this bridge, Zabuza."},{"startMs":7643000,"endMs":7645000,"text":"What?"},{"startMs":7645000,"endMs":7649000,"text":"That's right. You're too expensive, so I've decided to take you off the payroll..."},{"startMs":7649000,"endMs":7660000,"text":"Of course, even these thugs I brought with me cost something, so if you could manage to slaughter a few of them before they take you down, I'd appreciate it."},{"startMs":7660000,"endMs":7664000,"text":"Think you can manage that, Demon Ninja of the Mist?!"},{"startMs":7664000,"endMs":7665000,"text":"Look at you..."},{"startMs":7665000,"endMs":7668000,"text":"You look about as demonic as a wet kitten."},{"startMs":7668000,"endMs":7672000,"text":"[crowd laughter] [thinking] There are so many of them!"},{"startMs":7672000,"endMs":7675000,"text":"One rogue ninja was bad enough!"},{"startMs":7675000,"endMs":7680000,"text":"Well, well, Kakashi. It would seem our fight is at an end."},{"startMs":7680000,"endMs":7685000,"text":"Since I'm no longer in Gato's employ, Tazuna is safe."},{"startMs":7685000,"endMs":7687000,"text":"We have no quarrel."},{"startMs":7687000,"endMs":7692000,"text":"Yeah. I suppose you're right."},{"startMs":7694000,"endMs":7697000,"text":"That reminds me."},{"startMs":7697000,"endMs":7700000,"text":"You little punk, you grabbed me and nearly broke my arm."},{"startMs":7700000,"endMs":7705000,"text":"I've been meaning to repay you for that."},{"startMs":7705000,"endMs":7706000,"text":"Aahhh!!!"},{"startMs":7706000,"endMs":7708000,"text":"Huh!!!"},{"startMs":7708000,"endMs":7711000,"text":"Huh! I only wish he was alive to feel it."},{"startMs":7711000,"endMs":7714000,"text":"Get awaaaay!"},{"startMs":7714000,"endMs":7717000,"text":"Get away from him you scum! Hey! Stop!... Use your head."},{"startMs":7717000,"endMs":7722000,"text":"Well what about you, Zabuza? You gonna let him do that?!"},{"startMs":7722000,"endMs":7723000,"text":"Be quiet, you fool."},{"startMs":7723000,"endMs":7725000,"text":"Haku's dead, what does it matter?"},{"startMs":7725000,"endMs":7727000,"text":"What?!"},{"startMs":7727000,"endMs":7730000,"text":"You mean you can just stand there and watch him get treated like a dog?"},{"startMs":7730000,"endMs":7734000,"text":"You and Haku were together for years, doesn't that mean anything?!"},{"startMs":7734000,"endMs":7737000,"text":"You don't understand the Way of Shinobi."},{"startMs":7737000,"endMs":7740000,"text":"I merely used him, just as Gato used me."},{"startMs":