three of you."},{"startMs":11770000,"endMs":11772000,"text":"These are the application forms."},{"startMs":11772000,"endMs":11776000,"text":"Application forms."},{"startMs":11776000,"endMs":11778000,"text":"You're repeating me, Sakura... This is all voluntary, it's up to each of you."},{"startMs":11778000,"endMs":11782000,"text":"If you don't feel ready, you can wait 'till next year."},{"startMs":11782000,"endMs":11785000,"text":"All right!!! Kakashi-sensei, you rock!"},{"startMs":11785000,"endMs":11787000,"text":"Don't slobber on my vest."},{"startMs":11787000,"endMs":11792000,"text":"Whoever wants to take the exams, sign the application and come to room 301 at the Academy."},{"startMs":11792000,"endMs":11796000,"text":"It's at 3 p.m. five days from now...That's it!"},{"startMs":11796000,"endMs":11797000,"text":"Ha-ha-ha-ha!"},{"startMs":11797000,"endMs":11802000,"text":"Chunin exams! Chunin exams!"},{"startMs":11805000,"endMs":11807000,"text":"Hm... Chunin exams..."},{"startMs":11807000,"endMs":11812000,"text":"I'll be up against a lot of really wicked ninja!"},{"startMs":11812000,"endMs":11816000,"text":"[thinking] Like that jerk with the purple paint on his face."},{"startMs":11816000,"endMs":11819000,"text":"And of course \"Mister attitude.\""},{"startMs":11819000,"endMs":11823000,"text":"Uuhhh!!! Aahhh!!!"},{"startMs":11823000,"endMs":11828000,"text":"All right!... Who's the grand champion?. That'd be me!"},{"startMs":11828000,"endMs":11832000,"text":"If I come out on top, becoming Hokage will be easy after that!"},{"startMs":11832000,"endMs":11838000,"text":"I have to accept it: Naruto's better than an old geezer like me, so I'll just retire and let him be Hokage."},{"startMs":11838000,"endMs":11840000,"text":"Yay!!"},{"startMs":11840000,"endMs":11848000,"text":"[laughing] [thinking] I hope I get the chance to fight that guy."},{"startMs":11854000,"endMs":11856000,"text":"[thinking] This is hopeless."},{"startMs":11856000,"endMs":11858000,"text":"I can't keep up with Sasuke."},{"startMs":11858000,"endMs":11863000,"text":"I can't even beat Naruto. I'll never pass these exams."},{"startMs":11864000,"endMs":11890000,"text":"[exotic drums] Hey, Naruto!.. Come and play Ninja with us, please!"},{"startMs":11890000,"endMs":11894000,"text":"Sure. I don't have any \"dangerous ninja missions\" today, so, no problem!"},{"startMs":11894000,"endMs":11896000,"text":"Excellent! Excellent! Excellent!"},{"startMs":11896000,"endMs":11899000,"text":"Uh!?"},{"startMs":11899000,"endMs":11900000,"text":"Ha-ha! Aahhh!!!"},{"startMs":11900000,"endMs":11902000,"text":"Aahhh!!! Aahhh!!!"},{"startMs":11902000,"endMs":11905000,"text":"Aghhhh... Naruto! Konohamaru! Help!"},{"startMs":11905000,"endMs":11908000,"text":"What're you doing with Moegi, ya big slug!"},{"startMs":11908000,"endMs":11909000,"text":"Let her go... now!!"},{"startMs":11909000,"endMs":11912000,"text":"Ha-ha!!!"},{"startMs":11912000,"endMs":11913000,"text":"Aahhh!!!"},{"startMs":11913000,"endMs":11914000,"text":"Come on, Konohamaru!"},{"startMs":11914000,"endMs":11915000,"text":"Aahhh!!!"},{"startMs":11915000,"endMs":11916000,"text":"I'm with ya, boss!"},{"startMs":11916000,"endMs":11921000,"text":"Hold on!"},{"startMs":11960000,"endMs":11962000,"text":"WOW!"},{"startMs":11962000,"endMs":11964000,"text":"\"CONGRATS ON YOUR NEW, MORE DELICIOUS..."},{"startMs":11964000,"endMs":11967000,"text":"\"POST FRUITY PEBBLES CEREAL, PART OF A GOOD BREAKFAST.\""},{"startMs":11967000,"endMs":11969000,"text":"I'M YOUR AVATAR, DO YOU WANT TO PLAY?"},{"startMs":11969000,"endMs":11973000,"text":"BOWLING FOR FRUITY PEBBLES? OKAY!"},{"startMs":11973000,"endMs":11975000,"text":"BLUE... ORANGE... YELLOW..."},{"startMs":11975000,"endMs":11977000,"text":"PURPLE... GREEN... PINK... AND RED."},{"startMs":11977000,"endMs":11979000,"text":"I WANT THOSE BETTER TASTING PEBBLES!"},{"startMs":11979000,"endMs":11980000,"text":"YIKES!"},{"startMs":11980000,"endMs":11981000,"text":"SO GOODBYE, FRED."},{"startMs":11981000,"endMs":11986000,"text":"HELLO, EXPLODING FRUITY PEBBLES FLAVOR, EVEN MORE DELICIOUS THAN BEFORE."},{"startMs":11986000,"endMs":11988000,"text":"BARNEY! MY PEBBLES!"},{"startMs":11988000,"endMs":11993000,"text":"GAME OVER!"},{"startMs":12021000,"endMs":12023000,"text":"I JUST LOVE APPLE DIPPERS!"},{"startMs":12023000,"endMs":12028000,"text":"WELL, IF YOU LOVE THEM SO MUCH, WHY DON'T YOU JUST MARRY 'EM?"},{"startMs":12028000,"endMs":12037000,"text":"♪♪ I NOW PRONOUNCE YOU MR. AND MRS. APPLE DIPPER."},{"startMs":12037000,"endMs":12038000,"text":"YOU SCARE ME."},{"startMs":12038000,"endMs":12045000,"text":"♪♪ I CAN MAKE A BUNCH OF NEW FRIENDS AT McDONALD'S."},{"startMs":12045000,"endMs":12052000,"text":"NOW THAT BUILD-A-BEAR WORKSHOP MINIS ARE BACK, I CAN GET A NEW BEST FRIEND IN EVERY HAPPY MEAL."},{"startMs":12066000,"endMs":12067000,"text":"(girl) WE GOTTA HELP HIM!"},{"startMs":12067000,"endMs":12069000,"text":"(boy) LOOK, THERE HE IS!"},{"startMs":12069000,"endMs":12070000,"text":"(boy) WE SAW YOUR S.O.S."},{"startMs":12070000,"endMs":12072000,"text":"S.U.S., STIRRING UP SINGLES."},{"startMs":12072000,"endMs":12073000,"text":"(announcer) NEW KOOL-AID SINGLES."},{"startMs":12073000,"endMs":12074000,"text":"YOU MAKE IT YOURSELF."},{"startMs":12074000,"endMs":12076000,"text":"GRAB A GLASS. (all) COOL!"},{"startMs":12076000,"endMs":12077000,"text":"(announcer) KOOL-AID SINGLES, THEY'RE FAST IN A GLASS."},{"startMs":12077000,"endMs":12078000,"text":"OR A BOTTLE."},{"startMs":12078000,"endMs":12083000,"text":"(Kool-Aid Man) OH YEAH!"},{"startMs":12096000,"endMs":12098000,"text":"Hey."},{"startMs":12098000,"endMs":12101000,"text":"Sasuke! What's up?"},{"startMs":12101000,"endMs":12104000,"text":"Let's take a walk, just you and me."},{"startMs":12104000,"endMs":12107000,"text":"No way!... You mean it?"},{"startMs":12107000,"endMs":12112000,"text":"[evil sounds] Well-well. He can keep up with me at this speed."},{"startMs":12112000,"endMs":12117000,"text":"I'll get this creep! Moegi!"},{"startMs":12117000,"endMs":12122000,"text":"Oh man, this is bad. Where's the boss, we gotta find the boss."},{"startMs":12124000,"endMs":12127000,"text":"(Moegi) Nooo! You let me go!"},{"startMs":12127000,"endMs":12129000,"text":"[laughing] I thought the Hidden Leaf Village had powerful ninja..."},{"startMs":12129000,"endMs":12134000,"text":"but now I see you're nothing, just a bunch of weaklings."},{"startMs":12134000,"endMs":12135000,"text":"Hm?"},{"startMs":12135000,"endMs":12138000,"text":"Well, that was quick."},{"startMs":12138000,"endMs":12139000,"text":"Hey you! Yeah, you, the fat old guy!"},{"startMs":12139000,"endMs":12143000,"text":"What do you think you're doing with Moegi?"},{"startMs":12143000,"endMs":12145000,"text":"[laughing] What am I doing? Is that your question?"},{"startMs":12145000,"endMs":12147000,"text":"You really want to know?"},{"startMs":12147000,"endMs":12148000,"text":"Aahhh!!!"},{"startMs":12148000,"endMs":12151000,"text":"If you move, the brat's finished."},{"startMs":12151000,"endMs":12156000,"text":"Hey! Why are you doing this. She's just a kid let her go."},{"startMs":12156000,"endMs":12158000,"text":"I want the First Hokage's Scroll of Sealing."},{"startMs":12158000,"endMs":12160000,"text":"Bring it to me, and I'll let the girl go."},{"startMs":12160000,"endMs":12164000,"text":"The Scroll of Sealing?!"},{"startMs":12164000,"endMs":12170000,"text":"Um, Sasuke... How come all of a sudden you, y'know, wanna walk with me?"},{"startMs":12170000,"endMs":12176000,"text":"Cause I need to tell you... to give up on the chunin exams, there's no way you can pass them, Sakura."},{"startMs":12176000,"endMs":12180000,"text":"I was afraid of that... you're right."},{"startMs":12180000,"endMs":12183000,"text":"These ninja are very advanced and they have no mercy..."},{"startMs":12183000,"endMs":12187000,"text":"If you try to fight them, you could lose your life."},{"startMs":12187000,"endMs":12190000,"text":"But Sasuke, you're telling me this cause you care about me!"},{"startMs":12190000,"endMs":12193000,"text":"I, uh... guess that's true."},{"startMs":12193000,"endMs":12196000,"text":"[laughing] Two sweethearts. How touching."},{"startMs":12196000,"endMs":12199000,"text":"Get lost, unless you want to die."},{"startMs":12199000,"endMs":12202000,"text":"Talk is cheap! Aahhh!!!"},{"startMs":12202000,"endMs":12204000,"text":"Now I'm really mad!"},{"startMs":12204000,"endMs":12207000,"text":"Careful, Sasuke!!!"},{"startMs":12207000,"endMs":12210000,"text":"No way!"},{"startMs":12210000,"endMs":12213000,"text":"Ah!?"},{"startMs":12213000,"endMs":12217000,"text":"Sasuke!!"},{"startMs":12217000,"endMs":12230000,"text":"[synthesizer] Sasuke?"},{"startMs":12230000,"endMs":12232000,"text":"Sasuke!"},{"startMs":12232000,"endMs":12234000,"text":"Sasuke!!!"},{"startMs":12234000,"endMs":12237000,"text":"Mmmm! Mm!"},{"startMs":12237000,"endMs":12238000,"text":"Don't just stand there like a fool!"},{"startMs":12238000,"endMs":12241000,"text":"Hurry up and get the scroll!"},{"startMs":12241000,"endMs":12245000,"text":"Oh, yeah, right... And what happens if I say no?"},{"startMs":12245000,"endMs":12246000,"text":"Then I guess you don't care what happens to this girl."},{"startMs":12246000,"endMs":12248000,"text":"What girl?"},{"startMs":12248000,"endMs":12251000,"text":"All I see is two dummies, you and the one next to you made of straw."},{"startMs":12251000,"endMs":12255000,"text":"What, where'd she go?"},{"startMs":12255000,"endMs":12258000,"text":"She's right here, with the greatest ninja in the world!"},{"startMs":12258000,"endMs":12261000,"text":"Yeah, that's you, boss! You're my hero."},{"startMs":12261000,"endMs":12265000,"text":"The Clone Jutsu! I'll waste you, punk!"},{"startMs":12265000,"endMs":12269000,"text":"You just don't know when you're outclassed!"},{"startMs":12269000,"endMs":12271000,"text":"Waahhh!!!"},{"startMs":12271000,"endMs":12273000,"text":"Hey, boss, we're here!"},{"startMs":12273000,"endMs":12275000,"text":"Yeah, well it's about time, you guys!"},{"startMs":12275000,"endMs":12277000,"text":"Konohamaru, I was really scared."},{"startMs":12277000,"endMs":12280000,"text":"Okay, it's all right."},{"startMs":12280000,"endMs":12283000,"text":"Did you catch him, boss? Can we see him?"},{"startMs":12283000,"endMs":12286000,"text":"Sure, he's right here. I'll show you what he-uh?!"},{"startMs":12286000,"endMs":12289000,"text":"Hey, he used the Substitution Jutsu on you!"},{"startMs":12289000,"endMs":12292000,"text":"(Naruto) Copy cat, that's what I did to him!"},{"startMs":12292000,"endMs":12294000,"text":"You let him get away, boss! I see."},{"startMs":12294000,"endMs":12301000,"text":"[sobbing] [laughing] He's finished."},{"startMs":12301000,"endMs":12304000,"text":"And that's how you'll end up if you take the chunin exams."},{"startMs":12304000,"endMs":12307000,"text":"Oh, Sasuke..."},{"startMs":12307000,"endMs":12308000,"text":"Ha! I'm no idiot!"},{"startMs":12308000,"endMs":12312000,"text":"I saw right through that cheap Genjutsu from the first moment!"},{"startMs":12312000,"endMs":12314000,"text":"What!?"},{"startMs":12314000,"endMs":12316000,"text":"Sasuke inviting me out?..."},{"startMs":12316000,"endMs":12319000,"text":"Then suddenly acting like he's all worried about me?"},{"startMs":12319000,"endMs":12321000,"text":"Yeah like he'd ever."},{"startMs":12321000,"endMs":12323000,"text":"That was a foolish mistake."},{"startMs":12323000,"endMs":12324000,"text":"You thought I'd fall for that?"},{"startMs":12324000,"endMs":12326000,"text":"Are you calling me a fool?"},{"startMs":12326000,"endMs":12329000,"text":"I would if you were really here, but you're just an illusion."},{"startMs":12329000,"endMs":12330000,"text":"The real ninja ran away, like a coward."},{"startMs":12330000,"endMs":12333000,"text":"So you're just the illusion of a coward."},{"startMs":12333000,"endMs":12338000,"text":"[laughing] Are you sure I'm not real!"},{"startMs":12342000,"endMs":12345000,"text":"Yeah, I'm sure."},{"startMs":12345000,"endMs":12348000,"text":"[laughing] Just what I'd expect from a kunoichi trained by Kakashi."},{"startMs":12348000,"endMs":12351000,"text":"But the chunin exams will be more than illusions!"},{"startMs":12351000,"endMs":12354000,"text":"We'll see if you can cut it!"},{"startMs":12354000,"endMs":12358000,"text":"You don't scare me! Illusions or not, bring 'em on!"},{"startMs":12358000,"endMs":12363000,"text":"The chunin exams... Big bad chunin exams!..."},{"startMs":12363000,"endMs":12367000,"text":"Actually, I'm really worried about them."},{"startMs":12367000,"endMs":12368000,"text":"Aahhh!!!"},{"startMs":12368000,"endMs":12371000,"text":"Uh-uuhhh!!!"},{"startMs":12371000,"endMs":12373000,"text":"Uh!"},{"startMs":12373000,"endMs":12377000,"text":"Stay out of our village."},{"startMs":12377000,"endMs":12385000,"text":"[dog barking] So how'd it go?"},{"startMs":12385000,"endMs":12391000,"text":"They all made it. Your squad, and the others: all nine genin proved themselves ready for the exam."},{"startMs":12391000,"endMs":12394000,"text":"You were right, Kakashi, they're good ..."},{"startMs":12394000,"endMs":12397000,"text":"they've all developed very impressive skills."},{"startMs":12397000,"endMs":12401000,"text":"Mm... but the Chunin exams can break anyone."},{"startMs":12401000,"endMs":12404000,"text":"We'll see if they can tough it out."},{"startMs":12404000,"endMs":12408000,"text":"Did you hear we are going to have rookies at the exams: first year genin."},{"startMs":12408000,"endMs":12411000,"text":"That has not happened in five years..."},{"startMs":12411000,"endMs":12415000,"text":"No way. I bet it's just some Jonin trying boost their egos."},{"startMs":12415000,"endMs":12418000,"text":"No, there is more to the story than that."},{"startMs":12418000,"endMs":12420000,"text":"Three of them are from Kakashi's squad."},{"startMs":12420000,"endMs":12423000,"text":"Huh?! Interesting."},{"startMs":12423000,"endMs":12427000,"text":"But not very."},{"startMs":12427000,"endMs":12432000,"text":"Either way, it's too bad for them. Hm-hm!"},{"startMs":12499000,"endMs":12503000,"text":"(Naruto) SOUP...YOUR MOUTH WILL GO CRAZY."},{"startMs":12503000,"endMs":12511000,"text":"♪ IN THAT RED AND WHITE CAN ♪ ♪ ONE SLURP AND YOU'LL UNDERSTAND ♪ ♪ CAMPBELL'S CHICKEN NOODLE MANIA ♪ COOL!"},{"startMs":12511000,"endMs":12514000,"text":"Announcer: CAMPBELL'S SOUPS WITH LESS SODIUM. M'M! M'M! GOOD!"},{"startMs":12514000,"endMs":12521000,"text":"♪♪ [ Guitar ] ♪♪"},{"startMs":12521000,"endMs":12522000,"text":"BUBBLICIOUS BURSTS?!"},{"startMs":12522000,"endMs":12524000,"text":"[ Kids Yelling ] BUBBLICIOUS BURSTS!!"},{"startMs":12524000,"endMs":12538000,"text":"♪♪ [ Splatter ]"},{"startMs":12538000,"endMs":12540000,"text":"GET SOAKED."},{"startMs":12540000,"endMs":12544000,"text":"BUBBLICIOUS BURSTS WITH A LIQUID CENTER."},{"startMs":12544000,"endMs":12549000,"text":"KELLOGG'S NEW YOGOS BITS WATERMELON SPLASH FRUIT-FLAVORED SNACKS."},{"startMs":12549000,"endMs":12553000,"text":"BIG, WATERMELON-Y TASTE IN EVERY BIT...BIT..."},{"startMs":12553000,"endMs":12562000,"text":"BIT BY BIT BY BIT YOU JUST SUBMIT 'CAUSE YOU CAN'T QUIT THE TASTE OF IT TIL LICKETY-SPLIT THERE'S JUST ONE BIT FOR YOU TO GET!"},{"startMs":12562000,"endMs":12563000,"text":"UH-OH."},{"startMs":12563000,"endMs":12567000,"text":"FRUITY-CHEWY-WATERMELON-Y FLAVOR ON THE INSIDE, COLORFUL CREAMY-YOGURTY ON THE OUTSIDE."},{"startMs":12567000,"endMs":12570000,"text":"A TASTE YOU'LL LOVE SO MUCH... YOU'LL HATE WHEN IT'S GONE."},{"startMs":12570000,"endMs":12575000,"text":"SLOW GO ON THE YOGOS NEW WATERMELON SPLASH."},{"startMs":12586000,"endMs":12591000,"text":"Uh, right... sorry, guys."},{"startMs":12595000,"endMs":12597000,"text":"Good morning... Sasuke."},{"startMs":12597000,"endMs":12600000,"text":"Yeah."},{"startMs":12600000,"endMs":12604000,"text":"[thinking] What's up with her?... She's different."},{"startMs":12604000,"endMs":12606000,"text":"[crowd chatter] What's going on up there? Can you see?..."},{"startMs":12606000,"endMs":12610000,"text":"[loud punch] Aahhh!!! Uuhhh!!!"},{"startMs":12610000,"endMs":12614000,"text":"You're taking the chunin exams, but you can't even get past us?"},{"startMs":12614000,"endMs":12616000,"text":"Why don't you just give up now, before you get hurt."},{"startMs":12616000,"endMs":12620000,"text":"Yeah, I think I hear your mommy calling you..."},{"startMs":12620000,"endMs":12624000,"text":"Please let us through. We're supposed to go in there."},{"startMs":12624000,"endMs":12627000,"text":"[loud punch] Aahhh!!!"},{"startMs":12627000,"endMs":12630000,"text":"That's harsh."},{"startMs":12630000,"endMs":12632000,"text":"Did you say harsh!?... Don't kid yourself..."},{"startMs":12632000,"endMs":12634000,"text":"we're being nice by comparison!..."},{"startMs":12634000,"endMs":12638000,"text":"the exams are going to make this look like a picnic."},{"startMs":12638000,"endMs":12643000,"text":"Some of you won't survive the exams; others'll be wrecked for life; and some of you may go crazy..."},{"startMs":12643000,"endMs":12646000,"text":"For chunin, it's always life and death."},{"startMs":12646000,"endMs":12647000,"text":"You think it's a joke?"},{"startMs":12647000,"endMs":12650000,"text":"Chunin are qualified to lead missions..."},{"startMs":12650000,"endMs":12654000,"text":"the lives of your squad members are in your hands, so you better be tough enough to take the heat."},{"startMs":12654000,"endMs":12658000,"text":"Delicate little girls don't belong here."},{"startMs":12658000,"endMs":12659000,"text":"We're just \"thinning out the herd.\""},{"startMs":12659000,"endMs":12662000,"text":"You won't pass anyway, so go home and play with your dolls."},{"startMs":12662000,"endMs":12665000,"text":"Real nice speech..."},{"startMs":12665000,"endMs":12668000,"text":"Now both of you step aside and let me through."},{"startMs":12668000,"endMs":12670000,"text