warned."},{"startMs":14519000,"endMs":14521000,"text":"Oh, Sasuke."},{"startMs":14521000,"endMs":14524000,"text":"M-meah! How bout that?"},{"startMs":14524000,"endMs":14527000,"text":"Looks like the Uchihas aren't as great as everybody thinks they are."},{"startMs":14527000,"endMs":14529000,"text":"Naruto!"},{"startMs":14529000,"endMs":14532000,"text":"Ah!... Just shut up."},{"startMs":14532000,"endMs":14534000,"text":"Next time I'll drive him to his knees."},{"startMs":14534000,"endMs":14536000,"text":"Yeah, right... Who just got his butt kicked?"},{"startMs":14536000,"endMs":14540000,"text":"Stop it! What are you saying!... Just cut it out, Naruto!"},{"startMs":14540000,"endMs":14544000,"text":"Rrrrrr!!!"},{"startMs":14544000,"endMs":14549000,"text":"You saw his hands... didn't you? When he took off the tape?"},{"startMs":14552000,"endMs":14557000,"text":"I bet ol' Bushy Brow has been training until he drops... day in and day out..."},{"startMs":14558000,"endMs":14562000,"text":"He trains harder than you..."},{"startMs":14562000,"endMs":14566000,"text":"That's all I'm saying."},{"startMs":14566000,"endMs":14576000,"text":"[drums beating] [thinking] Sasuke."},{"startMs":14578000,"endMs":14586000,"text":"[loud drum beats] Fine!... Hmm!"},{"startMs":14586000,"endMs":14588000,"text":"Hmm?!"},{"startMs":14588000,"endMs":14591000,"text":"This thing's starting to get interesting..."},{"startMs":14591000,"endMs":14596000,"text":"The Chunin exams... Can't wait to see what's next."},{"startMs":14597000,"endMs":14600000,"text":"Hm?! Right!"},{"startMs":14600000,"endMs":14604000,"text":"Let's get started... Naruto!... Sakura!"},{"startMs":14604000,"endMs":14609000,"text":"Yeah!!!"},{"startMs":14616000,"endMs":14620000,"text":"(Naruto) Whoaaaa! All these guys are here for the chunin exams?"},{"startMs":14620000,"endMs":14623000,"text":"Kiba, Shino, Hinata... Shikamaru and Choji..."},{"startMs":14623000,"endMs":14627000,"text":"Poor guys, it's a shame I've got to make them all look bad."},{"startMs":14627000,"endMs":14635000,"text":"But hey, after I ace the test and become Chunin, and then Hokage I'll make it up to them by letting them boil my ramen or something."},{"startMs":14639000,"endMs":14640000,"text":"I don't want to get cocky."},{"startMs":14640000,"endMs":14642000,"text":"But it's hard not to be when you're the best."},{"startMs":14642000,"endMs":14647000,"text":"Believe it."},{"startMs":14773000,"endMs":14790000,"text":"Naruto, @d You [heavy metal guitar]"},{"startMs":14825000,"endMs":14829000,"text":"Glad you came, Sakura. For e, and the others'."},{"startMs":14829000,"endMs":14831000,"text":"Huh?! Huh?! Huh?!"},{"startMs":14831000,"endMs":14836000,"text":"Now you can all formally register for the Chunin exam."},{"startMs":14837000,"endMs":14840000,"text":"Why? What do you mean?"},{"startMs":14840000,"endMs":14844000,"text":"You see, only groups of three are allowed to apply for and take the exam."},{"startMs":14844000,"endMs":14848000,"text":"That's the way it's always been."},{"startMs":14848000,"endMs":14852000,"text":"But, sensei you said the decision to take the exam was up to the individual."},{"startMs":14852000,"endMs":14854000,"text":"That's right. I did."},{"startMs":14854000,"endMs":14856000,"text":"Was that a lie?"},{"startMs":14856000,"endMs":14858000,"text":"Sort of."},{"startMs":14858000,"endMs":14863000,"text":"It is an individual decision but it affects all of you."},{"startMs":14863000,"endMs":14869000,"text":"I didn't tell you before because I didn't want the other guys pressuring you Huh!"},{"startMs":14869000,"endMs":14877000,"text":"At the same time, I didn't want you feeling obliged to participate because of any feelings you might have for Sasuke. Or Naruto."},{"startMs":14878000,"endMs":14881000,"text":"I wanted you to come to a decision of your own free will."},{"startMs":14881000,"endMs":14883000,"text":"Wait a minute."},{"startMs":14883000,"endMs":14887000,"text":"Do you mean if the others had shown up but I'd decided not to come with them?"},{"startMs":14887000,"endMs":14889000,"text":"It would've been the end of the line."},{"startMs":14889000,"endMs":14893000,"text":"If you hadn't come along, I couldn't have let the others in."},{"startMs":14893000,"endMs":14896000,"text":"But it's a moot point. You're all here and for the right reasons."},{"startMs":14896000,"endMs":14897000,"text":"Sakura..."},{"startMs":14897000,"endMs":14898000,"text":"Mm!"},{"startMs":14898000,"endMs":14900000,"text":"Naruto..."},{"startMs":14900000,"endMs":14901000,"text":"Hm!"},{"startMs":14901000,"endMs":14905000,"text":"...and Sasuke."},{"startMs":14905000,"endMs":14908000,"text":"I'm proud of you."},{"startMs":14908000,"endMs":14913000,"text":"for a better team... Good luck."},{"startMs":14913000,"endMs":14918000,"text":"(Naruto) We won't let you down, sensei. Believe it!"},{"startMs":14947000,"endMs":14951000,"text":"Woah! What's this?"},{"startMs":14951000,"endMs":14956000,"text":"Gee. I guess we're not alone."},{"startMs":14959000,"endMs":14964000,"text":"[thinking] Man... I had no idea there'd be so much competition."},{"startMs":14970000,"endMs":14975000,"text":"If being scary-looking is one of the tests, they've got me beat."},{"startMs":14975000,"endMs":14979000,"text":"(gulp) Sasuke! Where've you been?"},{"startMs":14979000,"endMs":14981000,"text":"Ah! Hm-hm!"},{"startMs":14981000,"endMs":14986000,"text":"(little laugh) Boy, you have no idea how much I was hoping you'd show up here."},{"startMs":14986000,"endMs":14988000,"text":"I've missed those brooding good looks of yours."},{"startMs":14988000,"endMs":14990000,"text":"(growl) Rrrrrr!!!"},{"startMs":14990000,"endMs":14993000,"text":"Hey, you porker! Back off, he's mine!"},{"startMs":14993000,"endMs":14998000,"text":"Miss Forehead they let you in? Still got those big frown lines on your billboard brow, I see."},{"startMs":14998000,"endMs":15001000,"text":"Leave my forehead out of it!"},{"startMs":15001000,"endMs":15003000,"text":"Mm!"},{"startMs":15003000,"endMs":15004000,"text":"Rrrrrr!!! Oh, it's you guys."},{"startMs":15004000,"endMs":15006000,"text":"Ah!"},{"startMs":15006000,"endMs":15009000,"text":"I knew this was gonna be a drag But I didn't know it was gonna be this lame."},{"startMs":15009000,"endMs":15013000,"text":"So all three stooges are here?"},{"startMs":15013000,"endMs":15016000,"text":"Hey, you know what, pipsqueak? Ah, forget it, you're a waste of time."},{"startMs":15016000,"endMs":15018000,"text":"(Naruto) Shikamaru Nara."},{"startMs":15018000,"endMs":15021000,"text":"Always complaining, never does anything about it."},{"startMs":15021000,"endMs":15022000,"text":"The laziest kid in the academy."},{"startMs":15022000,"endMs":15030000,"text":"(chewing and eating) Choji Akimichi. Akimunchy's more like it."},{"startMs":15030000,"endMs":15033000,"text":"I think he'd eat his own head if he could."},{"startMs":15033000,"endMs":15038000,"text":"Sorry, but Sasuke's all mine. Mm!"},{"startMs":15038000,"endMs":15040000,"text":"(Naruto) Ino Yamanaka. Now, she's annoying."},{"startMs":15040000,"endMs":15045000,"text":"And not just because she's got the same stupid thing for Sasuke that Sakura's got."},{"startMs":15045000,"endMs":15048000,"text":"Well, well, whattaya know."},{"startMs":15048000,"endMs":15050000,"text":"It looks like the whole gang's back together again."},{"startMs":15050000,"endMs":15052000,"text":"Oh Hi, Naruto."},{"startMs":15052000,"endMs":15053000,"text":"Hm?!"},{"startMs":15053000,"endMs":15056000,"text":"Uh?!"},{"startMs":15056000,"endMs":15065000,"text":"Hinata Hyuga. She's okay but I don't know why she gets all shy and embarrassed every time I even, like, look at her. It's kinda weird."},{"startMs":15066000,"endMs":15068000,"text":"Kiba Inuzuka and his dog Akamaru."},{"startMs":15068000,"endMs":15072000,"text":"Forget what I said about Ino this guy's the most annoying of all."},{"startMs":15072000,"endMs":15076000,"text":"Thinks he so cool..."},{"startMs":15076000,"endMs":15080000,"text":"Then there's Shino Aburame... Well, he's just weird."},{"startMs":15080000,"endMs":15085000,"text":"Kind of a mystery, But that doesn't mean he isn't annoying, too."},{"startMs":15085000,"endMs":15087000,"text":"You guys too, huh?"},{"startMs":15087000,"endMs":15090000,"text":"Man, everyone's here for this stupid thing."},{"startMs":15090000,"endMs":15093000,"text":"Yep. Here we all are, the nine rookies."},{"startMs":15093000,"endMs":15096000,"text":"(chuckle) This is gonna be fun."},{"startMs":15096000,"endMs":15099000,"text":"At least for those of us good enough to make the cut."},{"startMs":15099000,"endMs":15101000,"text":"Right, Sasuke?"},{"startMs":15101000,"endMs":15105000,"text":"Kiba, careful you don't get overconfident."},{"startMs":15105000,"endMs":15106000,"text":"Just wait, we're gonna blow you guys away."},{"startMs":15106000,"endMs":15108000,"text":"We've been training like crazy."},{"startMs":15108000,"endMs":15111000,"text":"Whattaya think we been doin'?"},{"startMs":15111000,"endMs":15114000,"text":"Sittin' around pickin' daisies? You don't know what training means!"},{"startMs":15114000,"endMs":15117000,"text":"Oh. Don't mind Kiba."},{"startMs":15117000,"endMs":15119000,"text":"I'm sure he didn't really mean anything by it."},{"startMs":15119000,"endMs":15122000,"text":"Huh? Uh?!"},{"startMs":15122000,"endMs":15124000,"text":"(bark) Hm?!"},{"startMs":15124000,"endMs":15129000,"text":"[thinking] Akamaru's looking plumper. Juicier..."},{"startMs":15132000,"endMs":15134000,"text":"What do you want?"},{"startMs":15134000,"endMs":15139000,"text":"What's wrong?"},{"startMs":15139000,"endMs":15141000,"text":"Thought maybe you hadn't seen it."},{"startMs":15141000,"endMs":15142000,"text":"Huh??"},{"startMs":15142000,"endMs":15144000,"text":"Didn't want you stepping on it."},{"startMs":15144000,"endMs":15149000,"text":"Why, you saving it for lunch?"},{"startMs":15185000,"endMs":15187000,"text":"AND STARS SOUP..."},{"startMs":15187000,"endMs":15188000,"text":"[SLURPING] YOUR MOUTH WILL BE OUT OF THIS WORLD!"},{"startMs":15188000,"endMs":15195000,"text":"♪ TWINKLE, TWINKLE CAMPBELL'S CHICKEN AND STARS ♪ ♪ OH WHAT A ROCKIN' SOUP YOU ARE ♪ ♪ CHICKEN AND STARS, WORTH LICKING THE DISH FOR ♪"},{"startMs":15195000,"endMs":15197000,"text":"WOW!"},{"startMs":15197000,"endMs":15200000,"text":"Announcer: CAMPBELL'S CHICKEN AND STARS SOUP, M'M! M'M! GOOD!"},{"startMs":15200000,"endMs":15202000,"text":"GO TIGERS!"},{"startMs":15202000,"endMs":15209000,"text":"[ Cheering ] FIRST THEY'RE SOUR,"},{"startMs":15209000,"endMs":15211000,"text":"THEN THEY'RE SWEET."},{"startMs":15211000,"endMs":15213000,"text":"[ Giggling ] IT'S OKAY. SOUR PATCH KIDS."},{"startMs":15213000,"endMs":15218000,"text":"SOUR. SWEET. GONE."},{"startMs":15245000,"endMs":15247000,"text":"WHY SETTLE FOR A BORING CHOCOLATE CEREAL..."},{"startMs":15247000,"endMs":15249000,"text":"WHEN YOU CAN GO BIG WITH NEW CHOCOLATE HONEYCOMB?"},{"startMs":15249000,"endMs":15254000,"text":"( crunching, splash ) GREAT CHOCOLATE TASTE IN HUMONGOUS PIECES!"},{"startMs":15254000,"endMs":15256000,"text":"AND NEW CHOCOLATE HONEYCOMB IS PART OF THIS GOOD BREAKFAST."},{"startMs":15256000,"endMs":15261000,"text":"IT'S BETTER WHEN IT'S BIGGER!"},{"startMs":15272000,"endMs":15276000,"text":"You might want to try keeping it down a little."},{"startMs":15276000,"endMs":15281000,"text":"I mean, no offense, but you're the \"nine rookies,\" right? Fresh out of the academy?"},{"startMs":15282000,"endMs":15286000,"text":"I wouldn't go making a spectacle of yourselves."},{"startMs":15286000,"endMs":15289000,"text":"Just cool it. This isn't a class field trip."},{"startMs":15289000,"endMs":15291000,"text":"Well, who asked you? Who are you?"},{"startMs":15291000,"endMs":15294000,"text":"I'm Kabuto Yakushi."},{"startMs":15294000,"endMs":15299000,"text":"But really. Look around you... You've made quite an impression. Uh!"},{"startMs":15308000,"endMs":15313000,"text":"Uh! Uh!"},{"startMs":15316000,"endMs":15319000,"text":"See those guys?"},{"startMs":15319000,"endMs":15322000,"text":"They're from the Rain Village. Very touchy. They all are."},{"startMs":15322000,"endMs":15325000,"text":"This exam makes everyone tense."},{"startMs":15325000,"endMs":15327000,"text":"And you don't want to rub them the wrong way right now."},{"startMs":15327000,"endMs":15332000,"text":"Uh-uh!"},{"startMs":15332000,"endMs":15334000,"text":"You can't help it."},{"startMs":15334000,"endMs":15337000,"text":"I mean, how could you know how things work, you're just rookies."},{"startMs":15337000,"endMs":15340000,"text":"You remind me of myself a while back."},{"startMs":15340000,"endMs":15343000,"text":"Kabuto, is that your name?"},{"startMs":15343000,"endMs":15344000,"text":"Yeah."},{"startMs":15344000,"endMs":15346000,"text":"This isn't the first time you've taken the exam?"},{"startMs":15346000,"endMs":15350000,"text":"No, it's... my seventh."},{"startMs":15350000,"endMs":15352000,"text":"Huh?"},{"startMs":15352000,"endMs":15356000,"text":"Well, they're held twice a year, so this will be my fourth year."},{"startMs":15356000,"endMs":15360000,"text":"Wow, a veteran! You must really be an expert by now."},{"startMs":15360000,"endMs":15361000,"text":"Yeah, sort of."},{"startMs":15361000,"endMs":15364000,"text":"Cool! You can give us all the inside tips!"},{"startMs":15364000,"endMs":15366000,"text":"Yeah, some expert, he's never passed."},{"startMs":15366000,"endMs":15371000,"text":"Well, seventh time's the charm, that's what they say, uh?"},{"startMs":15371000,"endMs":15374000,"text":"So I guess all of those rumors about this exam being tough are true."},{"startMs":15374000,"endMs":15377000,"text":"Oh, man. I knew this was gonna be a drag."},{"startMs":15377000,"endMs":15379000,"text":"Hang on. Don't give up hope yet."},{"startMs":15379000,"endMs":15383000,"text":"Maybe I can help you kids out a little."},{"startMs":15383000,"endMs":15385000,"text":"With my Ninja Info Cards."},{"startMs":15385000,"endMs":15388000,"text":"What the heck are those?"},{"startMs":15388000,"endMs":15394000,"text":"It's hard to explain, but these cards have been Chakra-encoded with everything I've learned over the past four years."},{"startMs":15394000,"endMs":15399000,"text":"I've got more than 200 of them. So you see, I haven't been completely wasting my time."},{"startMs":15401000,"endMs":15406000,"text":"They may not look like much to the naked eye... In fact, they appear blank."},{"startMs":15406000,"endMs":15409000,"text":"Don't want just anyone seeing this stuff."},{"startMs":15409000,"endMs":15412000,"text":"What are you doing?"},{"startMs":15412000,"endMs":15416000,"text":"You see, I'm using my Chakra to reveal their secrets."},{"startMs":15416000,"endMs":15418000,"text":"Like this, for example."},{"startMs":15418000,"endMs":15423000,"text":"(Sakura) Awesome, a map! Of what?"},{"startMs":15423000,"endMs":15427000,"text":"(Kabuto) It shows the geographical distribution of all the candidates who have come to take the Chunin exam."},{"startMs":15427000,"endMs":15432000,"text":"What villages they come from, and how many from each village."},{"startMs":15433000,"endMs":15438000,"text":"Why do you guys think they all come here to take the exam together, at the same time?"},{"startMs":15444000,"endMs":15448000,"text":"It's to foster friendship between nations, of course."},{"startMs":15448000,"endMs":15449000,"text":"International brotherhood and all that."},{"startMs":15449000,"endMs":15453000,"text":"And it's true enough, as far as it goes."},{"startMs":15453000,"endMs":15455000,"text":"But there's another reason."},{"startMs":15455000,"endMs":15457000,"text":"Yeah."},{"startMs":15457000,"endMs":15465000,"text":"You see, the important thing is that this way they can carefully regulate the total number of shinobi that end up in each village, thereby maintaining the balance of power."},{"startMs":15465000,"endMs":15469000,"text":"Oh, yeah. Balance of power... Mm!"},{"startMs":15469000,"endMs":15474000,"text":"Balance of Power. Big Deal. It's all a drag."},{"startMs":15474000,"endMs":15480000,"text":"If the balance isn't maintained, one nation could wind up with many more shinobi than its neighbors."},{"startMs":15480000,"endMs":15483000,"text":"And it might be tempted to attack them."},{"startMs":15483000,"endMs":15487000,"text":"So they try to maintain the status quo... Makes sense. I suppose..."},{"startMs":15487000,"endMs":15489000,"text":"Hm."},{"startMs":15489000,"endMs":15493000,"text":"Do those cards of yours have any info on the other candidates?... Individually?"},{"startMs":15493000,"endMs":15495000,"text":"They might."},{"startMs":15495000,"endMs":15498000,"text":"You have someone special in mind?"},{"startMs":15498000,"endMs":15500000,"text":"I might."},{"startMs":15500000,"endMs":15504000,"text":"Well, I can't promise my information is complete or perfect."},{"startMs":15504000,"endMs":15507000,"text":"But I've got something on just about everyone..."},{"startMs":15507000,"endMs":15509000,"text":"Including you guys, of course."},{"startMs":15509000,"endMs":15511000,"text":"So which one is it?"},{"startMs":15511000,"endMs":15512000,"text":"Tell me anything you know about them."},{"startMs":15512000,"endMs":15514000,"text":"A description, where they're from, whatever."},{"startMs":15514000,"endMs":15516000,"text":"Anything at all."},{"startMs":15516000,"endMs":15520000,"text":"He's Gaara of the Desert."},{"startMs":15520000,"endMs":15523000,"text":"And there's Rock Lee of the Leaf Village, while you're at it."},{"startMs":15523000,"endMs":15527000,"text":"Man, that's no fun, you even know their names. That makes it easy."},{"startMs":15527000,"endMs":15539000,"text":"(Choji) [loud burb] Here they are."},{"startMs":15539000,"endMs":15544000,"text":"Show them to me!"},{"startMs":15597000,"endMs":15599000,"text":"WHY SETTLE FOR A BORING CHOCOLATE CEREAL..."},{"startMs":15599000,"endMs":15601000,"text":"WHEN YOU CAN GO BIG WITH NEW CHOCOLATE HONEYCOMB?"},{"startMs":15601000,"endMs":15606000,"text":"( crunching, splash ) GREAT CHOCOLATE TASTE IN HUMONGOUS PIECES!"},{"startMs":15606000,"endMs":15608000,"text":"AND NEW CHOCOLATE HONEYCOMB IS PART OF THIS GOOD BREAKFAST."},{"startMs":15608000,"endMs":15613000,"text":"IT'S BETTER WHEN IT'S BIGGER!"},{"startMs":15716000,"endMs":15717000,"text":"Show them to me!"},{"startMs":15717000,"endMs":15722000,"text":"Hm?... Mm-hmm..."},{"startMs":15723000,"endMs":15727000,"text":"[thinking] I haven't a clue what's going on here, but I'll act like I do."},{"startMs":15727000,"endMs":15732000,"text":"Okay, first up is Rock Lee."},{"startMs":15734000,"endMs":15738000,"text":"(Kabuto) Looks like he's about a year older than you guys..."},{"startMs":15738000,"endMs":15742000,"text":"Mission experience: 11 C-ranks and 20 D-ranks..."},{"startMs":15742000,"endMs":15744000,"text":"His squad leader is Guy..."},{"startMs":15744000,"endMs":15751000,"text":"In the last twelve month his taijutsu has radically improved, but his other skills are pretty shaky."},{"startMs":15751000,"endMs":15758000,"text":"Last year he got a lot of attention as a Genin, but for some reason... he chose not to participate in the Chunin exam."},{"startMs":15759000,"endMs":15763000,"text":"This'll be his first time as a candidate, same as you guys."},{"startMs":15763000,"endMs":15768000,"text":"His teammates are Ten Ten and Neji Hyuga."},{"startMs":15770000,"endMs":15773000,"text":"Huh? Hyuga?"},{"startMs":15773000,"endMs":15778000,"text":"Okay, now for Gaara of the Desert."},{"startMs":15782000,"endMs":15787000,"text":"Mission experience: 8 C-ranks and get this, 1 B-rank as a Genin!"},{"startMs":15789000,"endMs":15791000,"text":"There's not a lot more information on this guy."},{"startMs":15791000,"endMs":15794000,"text":"He was a rookie from another land originally."},{"startMs":15794000,"endMs":15797000,"text":"But there is this..."},{"startMs":15797000,"endMs":15802000,"text":"He's survived every mission without getting a scratch on him."},{"startMs":15802000,"endMs":15807000,"text":"The dude's done a B-rank as a Genin and has never even been injured?"},{"startMs":15807000,"endMs":15812000,"text":"What's the deal with this guy?"},{"startMs":15819000,"endMs":15824000,"text":"Leaf, Sand, Rain, Grass, Waterfall, Sound..."},{"startMs":15826000,"endMs":15832000,"text":"From the looks of it, they've all sent exceptionally skilled candidates to the exam this time around."},{"startMs":15832000,"endMs":15836000,"text":"Of course, the Hidden Sound Village is small."},{"startMs":15836000,"endMs":15838000,"text":"It sprang up recently, no one knows anything about it."},{"startMs":15838000,"endMs":15843000,"text":"Those guys are a mystery."},{"startMs":15844000,"endMs":15848000,"text":"Well, you get the point. The competition's going to be intense this year."},{"startMs":15848000,"endMs":15853000,"text":"So it would seem. It's almost enough to make you lose your confidence."},{"startMs":15853000,"endMs":15855000,"text":"It's a fine time to start talking like that!"},{"startMs":15855000,"endMs":15858000,"text":"Do you really think it's gonna be tougher this time?"},{"startMs":15858000,"endMs":15860000,"text":"Oh, yeah."},{"startMs":15860000,"endMs":15866000,"text":"In the four years I've been coming, I've never seen a crop of candidates with as much potential as this bunch."},{"startMs":15866000,"endMs":15867000,"text":"Hm!"},{"startMs":15867000,"endMs":15872000,"text":"(Kabuto) Yep, we've got our work cut out for us."},{"startMs":15872000,"endMs":15875000,"text":"I can't go along with this!"},{"startMs":15875000,"endMs":15877000,"text":"They may be under your care now, Kakashi, but I know these kids."},{"startMs":15877000,"endMs":15880000,"text":"They were my students, I trained them!"},{"startMs":15880000,"endMs":15885000,"text":"You know, he may be right, Kakashi. I don't know what you're trying to prove with this..."},{"startMs":15885000,"endMs":15890000,"text":"You're putting a lot of pressure on them. Why so impatient?"},{"startMs":15891000,"endMs":15895000,"text":"I held my team back for a year, so they could hone their skills and mature."},{"startMs":15895000,"endMs":15899000,"text":"Let them enjoy their youth a little longer."},{"startMs":15899000,"endMs":15901000,"text":"(chuckle) Your concern is touching."},{"startMs":15901000,"endMs":15906000,"text":"You sure it's not just because you know your guys don't stand a chance against mine?"},{"startMs":15907000,"endMs":15909000,"text":"All right, all right, that's enough."},{"startMs":15909000,"endMs":15912000,"text":"The matter of the rookies' participation is closed..."},{"startMs":15912000,"endMs":15917000,"text":"Now, as for the other Genin, I'm ready to consider your recommendations..."},{"startMs":15918000,"endMs":15923000,"text":"I know what I'm doing. You'll see."},{"startMs":15923000,"endMs":15928000,"text":"[thinking] I wish I was as sure as I sounded..."},{"startMs":15928000,"endMs":15932000,"text":"I wonder how they're doing? Even the cockiest of them must be a little scare ..."},{"startMs":15932000,"endMs":15941000,"text":"[thinking] Okay, so we're just rookies and most of these guys are older and more experienced than we are. No big deal. It's okay to be a little scared."},{"startMs":15943000,"endMs":15951000,"text":"I can handle it... But it'd be a whole lot easier if I didn't have to watch Naruto falling apart right in front of me. I mean,"},{"startMs":15951000,"endMs":15954000,"text":"nothing usually gets to him."},{"startMs":15954000,"endMs":15958000,"text":"Poor guy... Maybe I can try to cheer him up."},{"startMs":15958000,"endMs":15963000,"text":"Hey. Don't worry, Naruto, we'll be fine... Huh?!"},{"startMs":15963000,"endMs":15968000,"text":"Mm! Aahhh!!!..."},{"startMs":15971000,"endMs":15976000,"text":"My name is Naruto Uzumaki! And I'm gonna beat every one of ya!"},{"startMs":15977000,"endMs":15978000,"text"